u00e9cieuse de livres anciens, modernes et contemporains.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"Bibliotheca Wittockiana - Museum van de Boekkunsten en de Boekband","address_street_name":"Bemelstraat","address_street_number":"23","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@wittockiana.org","website":"http:\/\/www.wittockiana.org","phone_contact":"+32 2 770 53 33","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1150","address_city":"Sint-Pieters-Woluwe","address_line1":"Bemelstraat, 23","address_line2":"1150 Sint-Pieters-Woluwe","description_web":"De Bibliotheca Wittockiana biedt onderdak aan een van de mooiste en meest prestigieuze boekbandcollecties ter wereld. In het leven geroepen door een enthousiaste boekenliefhebber, is het de enige instelling in zijn soort in Belgi\u00eb en het buitenland. De permanente collectie, die enkel op afspraak te bezichtigen is, bevat meer dan 3000 kunstbindingen van de 16de tot de 21ste eeuw. Wittockiana organiseert ongeveer vier tijdelijke tentoonstellingen per jaar over boekbinden en boekenkunsten.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"Bibliotheca Wittockiana","address_street_name":"Rue du Bemel","address_street_number":"23","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@wittockiana.org","website":"http:\/\/www.wittockiana.org","phone_contact":"+32 2 770 53 33","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1150","address_city":"Woluwe-Saint-Pierre","address_line1":"Rue du Bemel, 23","address_line2":"1150 Woluwe-Saint-Pierre","description_web":"A private collection of bookbindings from the Renaissance and expanded to include contemporary examples.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"de":{"name":"Bibliotheca Wittockiana: Msueum f\u00fcr Buch- und Buchbindekunst","address_street_name":"Rue du Bemel","address_street_number":"23","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@wittockiana.org","website":"http:\/\/