eel the presence of the beguines with their long black robes.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"de":{"name":"Le Jardin de ma Soeur","address_street_name":"A l'angle du quai au Bois \u00e0 Br\u00fbler et de la rue du Grand Hospice","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"info@lejardindemasoeur.be","website":"http:\/\/www.lejardindemasoeur.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 217 65 82","phone_booking":"+32 2 217 65 82","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"A l'angle du quai au Bois \u00e0 Br\u00fbler et de la rue du Grand Hospice","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Dieses malerische Caf\u00e9-Theater, das 1994 in der N\u00e4he des alten \"Grand B\u00e9guinage de Bruxelles\" er\u00f6ffnet wurde, \u00fcberrascht durch seine \u00fcberaus kleinen R\u00e4umlichkeiten. Doch daf\u00fcr ist das Programm ist umso \"gr\u00f6\u00dfer\". Reservierung empfohlen!","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"it":{"name":"Le Jardin de ma Soeur","address_street_name":"A l'angle du quai au Bois \u00e0 Br\u00fbler et de la rue du Grand Hospice","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"info@lejardindemasoeur.be","website":"http:\/\/www.lejardindemasoeur.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 217 65 82","phone_booking":"+32 2 217 65 82","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"A l'angle du quai au Bois \u00e0 Br\u00fbler et de la rue du Grand Hospice","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"sp":{"name":"Le Jardin de ma Soeur","address_street_name":"A l'angle du quai au Bois \u00e0 Br\u00fbler et de la rue du Grand Hospice","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"info@lejardindemasoeur.be","website":"http:\/\/www.lejardindemasoeur.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 217 65 82","phone_booking":"+32 2 