"Le JUBILE75 des Concerts de Midi pr\u00e9sente l'oeuvre jou\u00e9e le 15 janvier 1948: le c\u00e9l\u00e8bre Septuor op. 20 de Beethoven.","longdescr":"Le 15 janvier 1948 avait lieu le premier Concert de Midi \u00e0 Bruxelles. 75 ans plus tard, une journ\u00e9e festive est organis\u00e9e au cours de laquelle, \u00e0 16h00, sera rejou\u00e9 le programme du premier concert: le Septuor op. 20 de Beethoven. Sept \u00e9minents artistes se r\u00e9unissent pour nous pr\u00e9senter cette oeuvre majeure: Tatiana Samouil, violon, Tony Nys, alto, Karel Steylaerts, violoncelle, Adrien Tyberghein, contrebasse, Jean-Michel Charlier, clarinette, Luc Loubry, basson, Jean-Pierre Dassonville, cor.","performers":"Tatiana Samouil, violon, Tony Nys, alto, Karel Steylaerts, violoncelle, Adrien Tyberghein, contrebasse, Jean-Michel Charlier, clarinette, Luc Loubry, basson, Jean-Pierre Dassonville, cor.","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.concertsdemidi.be\/programme\/jubile75-16h","email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.548185"},"nl":{"name":"JUBILE75 des Concerts de Midi - Septuor de Beethoven","shortdescr":"Het JUBILE75 van de Middagconcerten stelt het werk voor dat gespeeld werd op 15 januari 1948: het beroemde Septet op. 20 van Beethoven.","longdescr":"Op 15 januari 1948 vond het allereerste Middagconcert plaats in Brussel. 75 jaar later wordt dit feestelijk gevierd met om 16u00 de uitvoering van het programma van 15 januari 1948. Het Septet op. 20 van Beethoven zal gespeeld worden door 7 uitmuntende musici: Tatiana Samouil, viool, Tony Nys, altviool, Karel Steylaerts, cello, Adrien Tyberghein, contrabas, Jean-Michel Charlier, klarinet, Luc Loubry, fagot, Jean-Pierre Dassonville, hoorn.","performers":"Tatiana Samouil, viool, Tony Nys, altviool, Karel Steylaerts, cello, Adrien Tyberghein, contrabas, Jean-Michel Charlier, klarinet, Luc Loubry, fagot, Jean-Pierre Dassonville, hoorn.","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.concertsdemidi.be\/nl\/programma\/jubile75-16u","email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.548185"},"en":{"name":"JUBILE75 des Concerts de Midi - Septuor de Beethoven","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.548185"},"de":{"name":"JUBILE75 des Concerts de Midi - Septuor de Beethoven","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.548185"},"it":{"name":"JUBILE75 des Concerts de Midi - Septuor de Beethoven","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.548185"},"sp":{"name":"JUBILE75 des Concerts de Midi - Septuor de Beethoven","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.548185"},"pt":{"name":"JUBILE75 des Concerts de Midi - Septuor de Beethoven","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.548185"},"cn":{"name":"JUBILE75 des Concerts de Midi - Septuor de Beethoven","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.548185"}},"place":{"id":488,"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Mus\u00e9es Royaux des Beaux-Arts de Belgique","address_street_name":"Rue de la R\u00e9gence","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@fine-arts-museum.be","website":"http:\/\/www.fine-arts-museum.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 508 32 11","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue de la R\u00e9gence, 3","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Les Mus\u00e9es Royaux des Beaux-Arts de Belgique sont constitu\u00e9s de six mus\u00e9es bruxellois: le Mus\u00e9e Oldmasters Museum, le Mus\u00e9e Modern Museum, le Mus\u00e9e Meunier Museum, le Mus\u00e9e Wiertz Museum, le Magritte Museum et le Mus\u00e9e fin-de-si\u00e8cle Museum.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":"Royal Museums of Fine Arts of Belgium","virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"Koninklijke Musea voor Schone Kunsten van Belgi\u00eb","address_street_name":"Regentschapsstraat","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@fine-arts-museum.be","website":"http:\/\/www.fine-arts-museum.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 508 32 11","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussel","address_line1":"Regentschapsstraat, 3","address_line2":"1000 Brussel","description_web":"Onder de hoede van de Koninklijke Musea voor Schone Kunsten van Belgi\u00eb staan zes afzonderlijke musea: het Mus\u00e9e Oldmasters Museum, het Mus\u00e9e Modern Museum, het Mus\u00e9e Meunier Museum, het Mus\u00e9e Wiertz Museum, het Magritte Museum en het Mus\u00e9e fin-de-si\u00e8cle Museum.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"Royal Museums of Fine Arts of Belgium","address_street_name":"rue de la R\u00e9gence","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@fine-arts-museum.be","website":"http:\/\/www.fine-arts-museum.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 508 32 11","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussels","address_line1":"rue de la R\u00e9gence, 3","address_line2":"1000 Brussels","description_web":"The Royal Museums of Fine Arts of Belgium assemble six different museums: the Oldmasters Museum, Modern Museum, Meunier Museum, Wiertz Museum, Magritte Museum and the Fin-de-Si\u00e8cle Museum.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"de":{"name":"Mus\u00e9es Royaux des Beaux-Arts de Belgique","address_street_name":"Rue de la R\u00e9gence","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@fine-arts-museum.be","website":"http:\/\/www.fine-arts-museum.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 508 32 11","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue de la R\u00e9gence, 3","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Die Mus\u00e9es Royaux des Beaux-Arts de Belgique \u2013 6 Museen, 7 Jahrhunderte der sch\u00f6nen K\u00fcnste, 20 000 Kunstwerke und Kunstgenuss vom Feinsten:\r\n\r\n\u2022\tIm Mus\u00e9e Magritte gibt es die weltweit gr\u00f6\u00dfte Sammlung von Werken des gro\u00dfen belgischen Surrealisten Ren\u00e9 Magritte zu entdecken\r\n\r\n\u2022\tIm Mus\u00e9e Fin-de-Si\u00e8cle erwartet den Besucher mit K\u00fcnstlern wie Khnopff, Spilliaert, Horta, Rodin, Gauguin, Mucha und Bonnard das besondere Fin-de-Si\u00e8cle-Ambiente, das um 1900 in Br\u00fcssel herrschte. Mehr als 30 K\u00fcnstler \u2013 vom Impressionismus \u00fcber den Jugendstil, von den sch\u00f6nen K\u00fcnsten bis zur Oper.\r\n\r\n\u2022\tIm Mus\u00e9e Old Master gibt es Meisterwerke aus der Epoche des 15. Jahrhunderts bis hin zum 18. Jahrhundert zu sehen, unter anderem mit der weltweit gr\u00f6\u00dften Bruegel-Sammlung, verschiedenen Werken von Rubens, van der Weyden und Jordaens. \r\n\r\n\u2022\tDas Mus\u00e9e Modern Art zeigt eine Auswahl von Meisterwerken des 20. Jahrhunderts, darunter Broodthaers, Fabre, David, Panamarenko, Alechinsky.\r\n\r\n\u2022\tDie beiden Kunstatelier-Museen Mus\u00e9e Wiertz und Meunier in Ixelles geben einen faszinierenden Einblick in die Welt dieser beiden K\u00fcnstler.\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"it":{"name":"Museo Reale delle Belle Arti del Belgio","address_street_name":"Rue de la R\u00e9gence","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@fine-arts-museum.be","website":"http:\/\/www.fine-arts-museum.be\/","phone_contact":"+32 2 508 32 11","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue de la R\u00e9gence, 3","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"I Musei Reali delle Belle Arti del Belgio sono sei musei di Bruxelles: l'Oldmasters Museum, il Mus\u00e9e Modern, il Meunier Museum, il Wiertz Museum, il Magritte Museum ed il Fin-de-si\u00e8cle Museum.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"sp":{"name":"Museos Reales de Bellas Artes de B\u00e9lgica","address_street_name":"rue de la R\u00e9gence","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@fine-arts-museum.be","website":"http:\/\/www.fine-arts-museum.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 508 32 11","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"rue de la R\u00e9gence, 3","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Los Museos Reales de Bellas Artes de B\u00e9lgica son seis museos situados en Bruselas: el Museo de Arte Antiguo, el Museo de Arte Moderno, el Museo Meunier, el Museo Wiertz, el Museo Magritte y el Museo de Fin de Siglo.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"pt":{"name":"Mus\u00e9es Royaux des Beaux-Arts de Belgique","address_street_name":"Rue de la R\u00e9gence","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@fine-arts-museum.be","website":"http:\/\/www.fine-arts-museum.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 508 32 11","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1