00eave d\u2019un accord\u00e9oniste de Bruxelles. Elle vous d\u00e9voilera le secret des plus grands violonistes et tentera de percer celui de la musique qui ouvre nos coeurs et nous transporte au del\u00e0 de nous-m\u00eames.\r\n\r\nDans le cadre du projet\u00a0\u00a0\u00ab Contes et muse\u0301es \u00bb initie\u0301 par la Fe\u0301de\u0301ration des conteurs professionnels.\u00a0\r\n\r\nPlus d'infos ?\u00a0Envoyez votre question \u00e0\u00a0public@kmkg-mrah.be\u00a0","performers":"Nathalie Dutilleul","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.mim.be","email":"info@mim.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 545 01 30","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.547528"},"nl":{"name":"Contes au mus\u00e9e : Les sages musiciens","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.547528"},"en":{"name":"Contes au mus\u00e9e : Les sages musiciens","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.547528"},"de":{"name":"Contes au mus\u00e9e : Les sages musiciens","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.547528"},"it":{"name":"Contes au mus\u00e9e : Les sages musiciens","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.547528"},"sp":{"name":"Contes au mus\u00e9e : Les sages musiciens","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.547528"},"pt":{"name":"Contes au mus\u00e9e : Les sages musiciens","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.547528"},"cn":{"name":"Contes au mus\u00e9e : Les sages musiciens","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.547528"}},"place":{"id":61,"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Mus\u00e9e Art & Histoire (MRAH)","address_street_name":"Parc du Cinquantenaire","address_street_number":"10","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@mrah.be","website":"https:\/\/www.artandhistory.museum","phone_contact":"+32 2 741 73 31","phone_booking":"+32 2 741 73 02","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Parc du Cinquantenaire, 10","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Embarquez pour un fascinant voyage \u00e0 travers l'art et l'histoire. Venez fl\u00e2ner parmi les momies \u00e9gyptiennes et les silex pr\u00e9historiques, vous promener entre les verres anciens et prendre du recul pour mieux contempler d'impressionnantes tapisseries m\u00e9di\u00e9vales. Venez vous immerger dans le monde oriental en croisant des Bouddhas d'Asie et voyager jusqu'\u00e0 l'autre bout de la terre pour apercevoir une gigantesque statue de l'\u00eele de P\u00e2ques. La magnifique collection d'Art Nouveau vous attend au bout du voyage.\r\nLe Mus\u00e9e Art & Histoire fait partie des Mus\u00e9es royaux d\u2019Art et d\u2019Histoire, appellation qui chapeaute, outre le Mus\u00e9e Art & Histoire, le mim (Mus\u00e9e des Instruments de Musique), la Porte de Hal et les Mus\u00e9es d\u2019Extr\u00eame-Orient actuellement ferm\u00e9s.\r\n\r\n\r\nLe Mus\u00e9e Art & Histoire fait partie des Mus\u00e9es royaux d\u2019Art et d\u2019Histoire, appellation qui chapeaute, outre le Mus\u00e9e Art & Histoire, le mim (Mus\u00e9e des Instruments de Musique), la Porte de Hal et les Mus\u00e9es d\u2019Extr\u00eame-Orient actuellement ferm\u00e9s. ","description_print":"Le Mus\u00e9e du Cinquantenaire illustre les activit\u00e9s humaines et artistiques des cinq continents \u2013 hormis l\u2019Afrique noire \u2013, de la Pr\u00e9histoire \u00e0 nos jours. Les collections remplissent quatre b\u00e2timents et sont regroup\u00e9es en quatre d\u00e9partements: l\u2019Antiquit\u00e9, les civilisations extra-europ\u00e9ennes, l\u2019arch\u00e9ologie nationale et les arts d\u00e9coratifs europ\u00e9ens.","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"Museum Kunst & Geschiedenis (KMKG)","address_street_name":"Jubelpark","address_street_number":"10","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@kmkg.be","website":"https:\/\/www.artandhistory.museum","phone_contact":"+32 2 741 73 31","phone_booking":"+32 2 741 73 02","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussel","address_line1":"Jubelpark, 10","address_line2":"1000 Brussel","description_web":"Maak een wereldreis door de geschiedenis! Wandel van prehistorische vuistbijlen naar Egyptische mummies. Snuistert tussen betoverende glas en zet een stap achteruit om de indrukwekkende Brusselse wandtapijten te bekijken. Ga de oosterse toer op tussen de Aziatische boeddha\u2019s en steek de Atlantische Oceaan over om Kuifjes \u2018beeldje met het gebroken oor\u2019. En dan is er nog de mooie collectie van Belgische art nouveau\u2026 U komt ogen en oren te kort!\r\n\r\nHet Museum Kunst & Geschiedenis maakt deel uit van de Koninklijke Musea voor Kunst en Geschiedenis (KMKG) die ook het Muziekinstrumentenmuseum (MIM), de Hallepoort en de Musea van het Verre Oosten (gesloten voor renovatie) bundelen.","description_print":"Het Jubelparkmuseum kan bogen op een imposante collectie kunstschatten en archeologische vondsten afkomstig uit de vijf continenten \u2013 met uitzondering van Zwart-Afrika \u2013 van de prehistorie tot op heden. De verzamelingen vullen vier gebouwen en zijn ingedeeld in evenveel departementen: Oudheid (het Nabije Oosten, Egypte, Griekenland, Rome en Byzantium), Niet-Europese Beschavingen (Islam, Azi\u00eb, Polynesi\u00eb & Micronesi\u00eb en Amerika), Nationale Archeologie en Europese Sierkunsten.","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"Art & History Museum (RMAH)","address_street_name":"Parc du Cinquantenaire","address_street_number":"10","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@mrah.be","website":"https:\/\/www.artandhistory.museum","phone_contact":"+32 2 741 73 31","phone_booking":"+32 2 741 73 02","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussels","address_line1":"Parc du Cinquantenaire, 10","address_line2":"1000 Brussels","description_web":"Embark on a fascinating journey through art and history! Come and stroll among the prehistoric flints and Egyptian mummies, walk between the ancient glasses and stand back to contemplate the impressive medieval tapestries. Immerse yourself in the oriental world as you pass Asian Buddhas and travel to the other side of the world to see a gigantic statue from Easter Island. You still have to admire the magnificent collection of Belgian Art Nouveau...\r\n\r\nThe Art & History Museum is part of the Royal Museums of Art and History (RMAH) that also cover the Musical Instruments Museum (MIM), Halle Gate and the Museums of the Far East (currently closed for renovation).","description_print":"The Cinquantenaire Museum is the headquarters of the Royal Museums of Art and History. It was erected at the end of the nineteenth century and is one of the most extensive museums in Belgium. The collections are divided according to four main themes: 1) National Archaeology; 2) Antiquity; 3) European Decorative Art; 4) Non-European Civilizations.","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"de":{"name":"Mus\u00e9e Art & Histoire (MRAH)","address_street_name":"Parc du Cinquantenaire","address_street_number":"10","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@mrah.be","website":"https:\/\/www.artandhistory.museum","phone_contact":"+32 2 741 73 31","phone_booking":"+32 2 741 73 02","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Parc du Cinquantenaire, 10","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Das Cinquantenaire-Museum, gelegen im Br\u00fcsseler Jubelpark, ist Teil der K\u00f6niglichen Museen f\u00fcr Kunst und Geschichte und bietet einen umfassenden und vielseitigen \u00dcberblick \u00fcber die Geschichte von den Hochkulturen der Antike bis hin zu den Kunststr\u00f6mungen der Gegenwart.\r\n\r\nAntike Sammlungen: \r\nDie antiken Sammlungen befassen sich mit den untergegangenen Hochkulturen von \u00c4gypten (Neuheit: das Grabmal von Nakht), Mesopotamien, Griechenland und Rom. Gezeigt werden au\u00dferdem die gro\u00dfen Kunststr\u00f6mungen Europas vom 10. Jahrhundert bis heute. Wandteppiche, Altaraufs\u00e4tze, Spitze, Goldschmiedekunst und Porzellan geh\u00f6ren zu den kostbaren H\u00f6hepunkten der Ausstellung.\r\n\r\nVon Mikronesien bis Amerika: \r\nDie nicht-europ\u00e4ischen Werke laden ihrerseits auf eine Reise ein: nach Mikronesien, Polynesien, Indien, S\u00fcdostasien, China und ins pr\u00e4kolumbische Amerika. In den eindrucksvollen Arch\u00e4ologie-S\u00e4len wird der Geschichte der Region von der Vorgeschichte bis zur Epoche der Merowinger neues Leben eingehaucht.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"it":{"name":"Museo Arte & Historia","address_street_name":"Parc du Cinquantenaire","address_street_number":"10","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@mrah.be","website":"https:\/\/www.artandhistory.museum","phone_contact":"+32 2 741 73 31","phone_booking":"+32 2 741 73 02","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Parc du Cinquantenaire, 10","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Situato nel cuore del complesso del Cinquantenario, il Mus\u00e9e du Cinquantenaire vi invita a viaggiatore attraverso i continenti dalla Preistoria al XX secolo. \r\n\r\n\r\nLe sue ricche collezioni sono suddivise in quattro grandi sezioni :\r\n\r\n- L'Antichit\u00e0 dove sono presentate le grandi civilt\u00e0 scomparse dell'Egitto, della Mesopotamia, della Grecia e di Roma.\r\n- Le Arti decorative europee dove scoprire le correnti artistiche dal X secolo ai giorni nostri.\r\n- Le Civilt\u00e0 non europee che invitano al viaggio: India, Sudest asiatico, Cina, America precolombiana.\r\n- L'archeologia nazionale per rivivere il passato delle nostre regioni, dalla Preistoria al periodo merovingio.\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"sp":{"name":"Museo de Arte e Historia","address_street_name":"Parc du Cinquantenaire","address_street_number":"10","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@mrah.be","website":"https:\/\/www.artandhistory.museum","phone_contact":"+32 2 741 73 31","phone_booking":"+32 2 741 73 02","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Parc du Cinquantenaire, 10","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Ad\u00e9ntrate en este edificio hist\u00f3rico, uno de los mayores museos de B\u00e9lgica erigido por el anterior rey belga Leopoldo II. Descubre una gran cantidad de objetos desde la prehistoria hasta la antig\u00fcedad y de las artes aplicadas europeas hasta una amplia colecci\u00f3n de arte no europea. Explora todo, incluyendo las interesantes exposiciones temporales, conferencias y otras actividades. Desafortunadamente, la p\u00e1gina web no es tan amplia como para mostrar toda nuestra colecci\u00f3n, compuesta por miles de tesoros del arte y objetos hist\u00f3ricos. Sin embargo, esperamos que nos visites y disfrutes descubriendo o redescubriendo el inmenso patrimonio que gestionamos y exhibimos. De hecho, para nosotros el arte y la historia no son muerte y temas pasados, si no una viva y constante fuente de inspiraci\u00f3n y diversi\u00f3n.\r\n\r\nEl Museo de Arte e Historia es parte de los Museos Reales de Arte e Historia(MRAH), que incluye el Museo de Instrumentos Musicales(MIM), la Puerta de Hal y los Museos del Lejano Oriente(recientemente cerrado por renovaciones).\r\n\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"pt":{"name":"Museu de Arte e Hist\u00f3ria (MRAH)","address_street_name":"Parc du Cinquantenaire","address_street_number":"10","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@mrah.be","website":"https:\/\/www.artandhistory.museum","phone_contact":"+32 2 741 73 31","phone_booking":"+32 2 741 73 02","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Parc du Cinquantenaire, 10","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Da arqueologia nacional \u00e0s artes decorativas europeias, passando pela antiguidade cl\u00e1ssica e pelas civiliza\u00e7\u00f5es n\u00e3o europeias, embarque numa fascinante viagem atrav\u00e9s da arte e da hist\u00f3ria num edif\u00edcio magn\u00edfico criado por L\u00e9opold II no parque do Cinquenten\u00e1rio em Bruxelas.\r\n\r\n-  Museu do Cinquenten\u00e1rio muda de pele e torna-se o Museu de Arte e Hist\u00f3ria!\r\n-  Museu do Cinquenten\u00e1rio desenvolveu um trabalho de reflex\u00e3o sobre a sua imagem. Este resultou numa campanha de reorganiza\u00e7\u00e3o global da institui\u00e7\u00e3o. Come\u00e7ou assim uma reconquista museogr\u00e1fica: a decis\u00e3o de organizar exposi\u00e7\u00f5es tempor\u00e1rias baseadas nas pr\u00f3prias cole\u00e7\u00f5es do museu e de renovar progressivamente as salas permanentes, come\u00e7ando pelo armaz\u00e9m Wolfers, que foi a primeira etapa de uma s\u00e9rie de outras renova\u00e7\u00f5es (salas Egito, salas s\u00e9culos XIX e XX, maqueta de Roma\u2026) que atingem rapidamente a sua velocidade de cruzeiro. O\r\n- Museu de Arte e Hist\u00f3ria pertence aos Museus Reais de Arte e da Hist\u00f3ria, que englobam, para al\u00e9m deste, o MIM (Museu dos Instrumentos Musicais), a Porta de Hal e os Museus do Extremo Oriente, atualmente encerrados.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"cn":{"name":"Mus\u00e9e Art & Histoire (MRAH)","address_street_name":"Parc du Cinquantenaire","address_street_number":"10","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@mrah.be","website":"https:\/\/www.artandhistory.museum","phone_contact":"+32 2 741 73 31","phone_booking":"+32 2 741 73 02","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Parc du Cinquantenaire, 10","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null}},"districts":{"list":[9],"translations":{"fr":["Quartier europ\u00e9en"],"nl":["Europese wijk"],"en":["European Quarter"],"de":["Europ\u00e4isches Viertel"],"it":[null],"sp":[null],"pt":[null],"cn":[null]}},"zones":{"list":[22],"translations":{"fr":["Est"],"nl":["Oost"],"en":["East"],"de":["Osten"],"it":[null],"sp":[null],"pt":[null],"cn":[null]}},"neca":null,"facebook_id":null,"backoffice_id":12,"location":{"lat":50.83935087,"lon":4.3917188},"region":"brussels","last_updated_at":"2022-12-16T20:35:07+01:00","published_at":"2013-10-19T01:13:13+02:00","import_origin":null,"external_id":null,"is_in_address_book":true,"is_in_vb_export":true,"resto_ranking":0},"organizer":{"id":100473,"translations":{"fr":{"name":"MIM - Mus\u00e9e des instruments de musique (MRAH)","address_street_name":"Rue Montagne de la Cour","address_street_number":"2","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@mim.be","website":"http:\/\/www.mim.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 545 01 30","phone_booking":"+32 2 741 73 02","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue Montagne de la Cour, 2","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Le monde entier admire la collection du Mus\u00e9e des instruments de musique qui fait partie du groupement des Mus\u00e9es Royaux d\u2019Art et d\u2019Histoire. Ce Mus\u00e9e est camp\u00e9 au c\u0153ur des anciens b\u00e2timents Old England, un des plus beaux b\u00e2timents de style Art Nouveau de Bruxelles, datant de 1899. Ce mus\u00e9e est l\u2019un des plus riches au monde : quelques 1.200 instruments y sont expos\u00e9s. D\u2019int\u00e9ressantes animations et de nombreux concerts y sont programm\u00e9s.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"MIM - Muziekinstrumentenmuseum (KMKG)","address_street_name":"Hofberg","address_street_number":"2","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@mim.be","website":"http:\/\/www.mim.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 545 01 30","phone_booking":"+32 2 741 73 02","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussel","address_line1":"Hofberg, 2","address_line2":"1000 Brussel","description_web":"Het Muziekinstrumentenmuseum (MIM) bewaart een onschatbare collectie van muzikaal erfgoed en presenteert ze op een schitterende manier. Het MIM beschikt daarvoor over veel troeven. De intu\u00eftieve presentatie is aantrekkelijk en klantvriendelijk. De collectie huist bovendien in een schitterend gerestaureerd Art Nouveau pand. Het MIM presenteert een honderdtal middagconcerten per jaar en biedt een waaier aan groepsactiviteiten.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"MIM - Musical Instruments Museum (MRAH)","address_street_name":"Rue Montagne de la Cour","address_street_number":"2","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@mim.be","website":"http:\/\/www.mim.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 545 01 30","phone_booking":"+32 2 741 73 02","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussels","address_line1":"Rue Montagne de la Cour, 2","address_line2":"1000 Brussels","description_web":"As soon as it opened at the end of the 19th century, the luxurious Old England department store earned an excellent reputation for its highly distinctive building. The entrance to the building is a jewel of the Art Nouveau style, while the rest is in perfect harmony with the neoclassical ensemble on the Place Royale, and just around the corner from the Grand-Place and Central Station, no less! \r\nWith a wealth of some 9.000 instruments, some 1.200 of which are on permanent exhibit, the museum's reputation is mainly built on its extraordinary collections.\r\nOnce inside, you'll embark on a true tour of the musical world. After your visit, the instruments and their history will no longer hold any secrets: from the viola da gamba from the Court of Brussels to the 20th century theremin, and even including the African kora!\r\nThe mim is nothing other than a place to experience music. A visitor's guidance system allows you to explore the thematic tours to the tune of the melodious sound of the instruments presented.\r\nA program packed with concerts, demonstrations and workshops for the young and the not so young makes the mim experience even better.\r\nThe mim has its own concert hall, specialized library, museum shop, workshop for restauration and conservation of musical instruments and is crowned by a restaurant with panoramic view over Brussels.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"de":{"name":"MIM - Musikinstrumente-Museum (MRAH)","address_street_name":"Montagne de la Cour","address_street_number":"2","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@mim.be","website":"http:\/\/www.mim.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 545 01 30","phone_booking":"+32 2 741 73 02","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Montagne de la Cour, 2","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Das Br\u00fcsseler Musikinstrumente-Museum mit 1200 ausgestellten Musikinstrumenten und vielf\u00e4ltigen Sammlungen (mit insgesamt 8000 Instrumenten!), untergebracht in einem bemerkenswerten Jugendstilgeb\u00e4ude, ist ein Paradies f\u00fcr Musikinteressierte.\r\n\r\nMusikgeschichte und Jugendstilarchitektur: Das Musikinstrumente-Museum befindet sich in den ehemaligen Geb\u00e4uden des \u201eOld England\u201c-Kaufhauses und gilt als eines der herausragenden Beispiele f\u00fcr die Br\u00fcsseler Jugendstilarchitektur.\r\n\r\nMusikalische Welt- und Zeitreise: Auf vier Ebenen pr\u00e4sentiert das Museum Musikinstrumente aus verschiedenen Kulturkreisen und Epochen \u2013 und so begibt sich der Besucher auf eine musikalische Welt- und Zeitreise. Die Ausstellungsgestaltung verkn\u00fcpft gekonnt klangliche und visuelle Dimensionen.\r\n\r\nKulinarischer H\u00f6hepunkt, im wahrsten Sinne des Wortes, ist das Restaurant im 6. Stock mit Dachterrasse.\r\n\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"it":{"name":"Museo degli Strumenti Musicali","address_street_name":"Rue Montagne de la Cour","address_street_number":"2","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@mim.be","website":"http:\/\/www.mim.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 545 01 30","phone_booking":"+32 2 741 73 02","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue Montagne de la Cour, 2","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Il MIM presenta una collezione di strumenti musicali di fama internazionale e une larga gamma di attivit\u00e0 in collegamento con questa collezione a un pubblico largo e...\r\n\r\nIl MIM presenta una collezione di strumenti musicali di fama internazionale e une larga gamma di attivit\u00e0 in collegamento con questa collezione a un pubblico largo e diversificato dal Belgio e dall'estero. Presenta un'ampio panorama della musica antica, moderna, popolare e tradizionale.\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"sp":{"name":"El MIM, Museo de Instrumentos de M\u00fasica","address_street_name":"Rue Montagne de la Cour","address_street_number":"2","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@mim.be","website":"http:\/\/www.mim.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 545 01 30","phone_booking":"+32 2 741 73 02","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue Montagne de la Cour, 2","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"El Museo MIM te invita a contemplar y escuchar 1.200 instrumentos de m\u00fasica en un edificio Art Nouveau de Bruselas. \r\n\r\nEl Museo de Instrumentos de M\u00fasica, que forma parte de los Museos Reales de Arte e Historia, abre sus puertas en las proximidades de la Place Royale, en el Mont des Arts, el barrio de los museos de Bruselas. \r\n\r\nEl MIM se encuentra en los antiguos almacenes de Art Nouveau, Old England, un aut\u00e9ntico tesoro arquitect\u00f3nico de finales del s. XIX.\r\n\r\nEl MIM debe su reputaci\u00f3n, sobre todo, a sus extraordinarias colecciones. Ven a dar la vuelta al mundo musical a trav\u00e9s de sus 1.200 piezas distribuidas por las 4 plantas de la exposici\u00f3n.\r\n\r\n\r\nComo es de suponer, el MIM es el lugar ideal para disfrutar de la m\u00fasica. Un sistema de cascos con infrarrojos permite explorar los recorridos tem\u00e1ticos al tiempo que se escucha el sonido melodioso de los instrumentos que se presentan.\r\n   \r\nEl MIM tambi\u00e9n es\u2026\r\n\r\n- Una sala de conciertos\r\n- Un espacio para talleres\r\n- Un Museumshop\r\n- Una biblioteca especializada\r\n- Y un restaurante con terraza, con unas vistas \u00fanicas al centro hist\u00f3rico de la capital europea\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"pt":{"name":"MIM - Museu dos Instrumentos Musicais","address_street_name":"Rue Montagne de la Cour","address_street_number":"2","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@mim.be","website":"http:\/\/www.mim.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 545 01 30","phone_booking":"+32 2 741 73 02","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue Montagne de la Cour, 2","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Todo o mundo admira a cole\u00e7\u00e3o do Museu dos Instrumentos Musicais, que pertence ao conjunto dos Museus Reais de Arte e da Hist\u00f3ria. Este museu assenta no cora\u00e7\u00e3o dos velhos edif\u00edcios Old England, um dos edif\u00edcios mais belos de estilo Art Nouveau de Bruxelas, datando de 1899. Este museu \u00e9 um dos mais ricos do mundo: cerca de 1200 instrumentos encontram-se a\u00ed expostos. Consta da programa\u00e7\u00e3o de interessantes anima\u00e7\u00f5es e in\u00fameros concertos.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"cn":{"name":"MIM - Mus\u00e9e des instruments de musique (MRAH)","address_street_name":"Rue Montagne de la Cour","address_street_number":"2","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@mim.be","website":"http:\/\/www.mim.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 545 01 30","phone_booking":"+32 2 741 73 02","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue Montagne de la Cour, 2","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null}},"neca":null,"facebook_id":null,"backoffice_id":359,"location":{"lat":50.84274286,"lon":4.35903823},"region":"brussels","last_updated_at":"2022-12-16T20:35:07+01:00","published_at":"2013-10-19T01:13:28+02:00","import_origin":null,"external_id":null,"is_in_address_book":true,"is_in_vb_export":true,"resto_ranking":0},"media":[{"type":"photo","link":"https:\/\/agendabrussels.imgix.net\/ecfa96188a380189d184faa3c68066606b5c82bf.jpg","width":1640,"height":856,"ratio":1.92,"translations":{"fr":{"title":"Contes au mus\u00e9e : Les sages musiciens","copyright":"Contes au mus\u00e9e"},"nl":{"title":"Contes au mus\u00e9e : Les sages musiciens","copyright":"Contes au mus\u00e9e"},"en":{"title":"Contes au mus\u00e9e : Les sages musiciens","copyright":"Contes au mus\u00e9e"},"de":{"title":"Contes au mus\u00e9e : Les sages musiciens","copyright":"Contes au mus\u00e9e"},"it":{"title":"Contes au mus\u00e9e : Les sages musiciens","copyright":"Contes au mus\u00e9e"},"sp":{"title":"Contes au mus\u00e9e : Les sages musiciens","copyright":"Contes au mus\u00e9e"},"pt":{"title":"Contes au mus\u00e9e : Les sages musiciens","copyright":"Contes au mus\u00e9e"},"cn":{"title":"Contes au mus\u00e9e : Les sages musiciens","copyright":"Contes au mus\u00e9e"}}}],"dates":[{"day":"2023-01-15","doors":"11:00:00","start":"11:00:00","end":"12:15:00","is_soldout":false,"is_canceled":false},{"day":"2023-01-22","doors":"11:00:00","start":"11:00:00","end":"12:15:00","is_soldout":false,"is_canceled":false},{"day":"2023-01-22","doors":"15:00:00","start":"15:00:00","end":"16:15:00","is_soldout":false,"is_canceled":false}],"prices":[{"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Normal"},"nl":{"name":"Normaal"},"en":{"name":"Normal"},"de":{"name":"Normal"},"it":{"name":"Normal"},"sp":{"name":"Normal"},"pt":{"name":"Normal"},"cn":{"name":"Normal"}},"value":15},{"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Enfants"},"nl":{"name":"Kinderen"},"en":{"name":"Children"},"de":{"name":"Kinder"},"it":{"name":"Enfants"},"sp":{"name":"Enfants"},"pt":{"name":"Enfants"},"cn":{"name":"Enfants"}},"value":3},{"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Etudiants"},"nl":{"name":"Studenten"},"en":{"name":"Students"},"de":{"name":"Studierende"},"it":{"name":"Etudiants"},"sp":{"name":"Etudiants"},"pt":{"name":"Etudiants"},"cn":{"name":"Etudiants"}},"value":8},{"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Seniors"},"nl":{"name":"Senioren"},"en":{"name":"Seniors"},"de":{"name":"Senioren"},"it":{"name":"Seniors"},"sp":{"name":"Seniors"},"pt":{"name":"Seniors"},"cn":{"name":"Seniors"}},"value":13}],"child_events":[],"parent_events":[],"targets":{"list":[4,5,7],"translations":{"fr":["Enfants 6-9 ans","Enfants 9-12 ans","Jeunes 12-15 ans"],"nl":["Kinderen 6-9 j.","Kinderen 9-12 j.","Jongeren 12-15 j."],"en":["Children 6-9 yr.","Children 9-12 yr.","Youth 12-15  yr."],"de":["Kinder 6-9 Jahre","Kinder 9-12 Jahre","Jugendliche 12-15 Jahre"],"it":[null,null,null],"sp":[null,null,null],"pt":[null,null,null],"cn":[null,null,null]}},"tags":["kids"],"accessibilities":{"list":[255,259,261,263,265],"translations":{"fr":["Accessible","Chien d'assistance","Parking accessible","Accessible aux pi\u00e9tons appareill\u00e9s","WC adapt\u00e9"],"nl":["Toegankelijk","Assistentiehonden","Toegankelijke parking","Toegankelijk voor voetgangers met hulpmiddelen","Aangepast toilet"],"en":["Accessible","Assistance dogs","Accessible parking","Accessible to pedestrians with mobility aids","Adapted toilet"],"de":["Barrierefrei","Assistenzhund","Barrierefreier Parkplatz","Barrierefrei f\u00fcr Fu\u00dfg\u00e4nger mit Gehhilfe","Barrierefreies WC"],"it":[null,null,null,null,null],"sp":[null,null,null,null,null],"pt":[null,null,null,null,null],"cn":[null,null,null,null,null]}},"facebook_link":null,"publication_state":"public","last_updated_at":"2022-12-16T20:35:07+01:00","published_at":"2022-12-16T20:13:35+01:00","backoffice_id":267528,"import_origin":null,"sub_type":"theatre","show_in_agenda":true,"ranking":0.62996052494744},{"id":545430,"date_start":"2023-01-14","date_end":"2023-01-23","date_next":"2023-01-15","accept_article27":false,"accept_cultuurbon":false,"accept_paspartoe":false,"is_closed_on_public_holidays":false,"is_closed_on_school_holidays":false,"is_only_by_appointment":true,"is_permanent":false,"is_free":true,"is_online":false,"is_canceled":false,"is_soldout":false,"categories":{"main":{"id":102,"translations":{"fr":"Visites Guid\u00e9es","nl":"Begeleide rondleidingen","en":"Guided tours","de":"Stadtf\u00fchrungen","it":null,"sp":null,"pt":null,"cn":null}},"others":{"list":[104],"translations":{"fr":["Art Nouveau, Art D\u00e9co"],"nl":["Art nouveau, art deco"],"en":["Art Nouveau, Art D\u00e9co"],"de":["Jugendstil, Art d\u00e9co"],"it":[null],"sp":[null],"pt":[null],"cn":[null]}}},"languages":{"spoken":["fr","nl","en"],"subtitles":[]},"translations":{"fr":{"name":"La Maison Hannon, chef d\u2019\u0153uvre de l\u2019art nouveau : coulisses d\u2019un chantier de restauration","shortdescr":"Ic\u00f4ne de l\u2019Art nouveau \u00e0 Bruxelles, la Maison Hannon sera accessible au public en 2023 comme maison-mus\u00e9e, apr\u00e8s restauration. D\u00e9couvrez en avant-premi\u00e8re le travail en cours de restitution du b\u00e2timent \u00e0 son \u00e9tat original.","longdescr":"Chef-d\u2019\u0153uvre de l\u2019architecte Jules Brunfaut, la maison fut construite en 1902 pour \u00c9douard Hannon et Marie Debard qui en am\u00e9nag\u00e8rent l\u2019int\u00e9rieur comme un univers onirique et symboliste. Plus d\u2019un si\u00e8cle d\u2019histoire et de souvenirs ont n\u00e9anmoins laiss\u00e9 des traces... Grace \u00e0 l\u2019analyse des \u00e9l\u00e9ments originaux subsistants et de riches archives, la restauration du b\u00e2timent est en cours. Les clefs de compr\u00e9hension de ce travail vous seront livr\u00e9es, enrichies du t\u00e9moignage de la restauratrice des vitraux du b\u00e2timent.","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.maisonhannon.be","email":"info@maisonhannon.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 543 04 90","phone_booking":"+32 2 543 04 90","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.545430"},"nl":{"name":"Het Maison Hannon, een meesterwerk van art nouveau: achter de schermen van een restauratieproject","shortdescr":"Het Maison Hannon, een icoon van de art nouveau in Brussel, zal na restauratie, in 2023 toegankelijk zijn voor het publiek als woning-museum. Ontdek een voorproefje van de lopende werkzaamheden die het gebouw in zijn oorspronkelijke staat zullen herstellen.","longdescr":"Het huis, een meesterwerk van architect Jules Brunfaut, werd in 1902 gebouwd voor Edouard Hannon en Marie Debard, die het interieur ontwierpen als een dromerig, symbolistisch universum. Meer dan een eeuw geschiedenis en herinneringen hebben desalniettemin hun sporen nagelaten... De restauratie van het gebouw is, dankzij de analyse van de overgebleven originele elementen en de rijke archieven, aan de gang. U krijgt de sleutels tot het begrijpen van dit werk, verrijkt met de getuigenis van de restaurateur van de gebrandschilderde ramen van het gebouw.","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.545430"},"en":{"name":"The Maison Hannon, a masterpiece of art nouveau: behind the scenes","shortdescr":"An icon of Art Nouveau in Brussels, the Maison Hannon will be accessible to the public in 2023 as a house museum, following restoration. Discover a preview of the work in progress to restore the building to its original state.","longdescr":"A masterpiece of the architect Jules Brunfaut, the house was built in 1902 for Edouard Hannon and Marie Debard, who designed the interior as a dreamlike, symbolist universe. More than a century of history and memories have nevertheless left their mark... Thanks to the analysis of the remaining original elements and rich archives, the restoration of the building is underway. The keys to understanding this work will be given to you, and will include a presentation by the restorer of the building's stained glass windows.","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.545430"},"de":{"name":"Visite de chantier","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.545430"},"it":{"name":"Visite de chantier","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.545430"},"sp":{"name":"Visite de chantier","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.545430"},"pt":{"name":"Visite de chantier","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.545430"},"cn":{"name":"Visite de chantier","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.545430"}},"place":{"id":244861,"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Maison Hannon","address_street_name":"Avenue de la Jonction","address_street_number":"1","address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1060","address_city":"Saint-Gilles","address_line1":"Avenue de la Jonction, 1","address_line2":"1060 Saint-Gilles","description_web":"C'est en 1902 que l'ing\u00e9nieur Edouard Hannon (1853-1931) fit appel \u00e0 son ami l'architecte Jules Brunfaut (1852-1942) pour \u00e9difier ce bel h\u00f4tel de ma\u00eetre de style Art Nouveau.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"Hannon Huis","address_street_name":"Verbindingslaan","address_street_number":"1","address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1060","address_city":"Sint-Gillis","address_line1":"Verbindingslaan, 1","address_line2":"1060 Sint-Gillis","description_web":"In 1902 doet ingenieur Edouard Hannon (1853-1931) een beroep op zijn goede vriend, de architect Jules Brunfaut (1852-1942), voor de bouw van dit fraaie herenhuis in art nouveau.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"Hannon House","address_street_name":"Avenue de la Jonction","address_street_number":"1","address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1060","address_city":"Saint-Gilles","address_line1":"Avenue de la Jonction, 1","address_line2":"1060 Saint-Gilles","description_web":"In 1902 the engineer Edouard Hannon (1853 - 1931) called upon his friend, the architect Jules Brunfaut (1852 - 1942) to build this mansion, a masterpiece in the Art Nouveau style.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"de":{"name":"Maison Hannon","address_street_name":"Av. de la Jonction","address_street_number":"1","address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1060","address_city":"Saint-Gilles","address_line1":"Av. de la Jonction, 1","address_line2":"1060 Saint-Gilles","description_web":"Edouard Hannon, Ingenieur der Gesellschaft Solvay und einer der Vertreter der industriellen Bourgeoisie, erwarb 1902 ein Grundst\u00fcck an der Avenue Brugman und beauftragte den Architekten Jules Brunfaut mit dem Bau eines prachtvollen Herrenhauses im Jugendstil.\r\n\r\nJules Brunfaut z\u00e4hlte bis dato nicht zu den Jugendstil-Architekten. Er bediente sich dieses Stils lediglich, um seinem Freund und Gesch\u00e4ftspartner einen Gefallen zu tun. 1903, als sich der Jugendstil auch international durchgesetzt hatte, wagte er sich an neue Stilelemente heran: Ihm sind die Fenster im Tiffany-Stil zu verdanken. Und es wird deutlich, wer Brunfauts Vorbilder waren: Victor Horta und Octave van Rijsselberghe (der Architekt des H\u00f4tel Otlet und H\u00f4tel de Brouck\u00e8re).\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"it":{"name":"Maison Hannon","address_street_name":"Avenue de la Jonction","address_street_number":"1","address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking"