e9veillent, souvent, ils ne se souviennent pas de leurs r\u00eaves, et jamais des trois petites cr\u00e9atures. \u2028Attrist\u00e9s de cela, \u2028Twig, Splash et Scratch d\u00e9cident de venir sur la Terre, \u2028avec leurs marionnettes, en pleine journ\u00e9e afin de pouvoir r\u00eaver avec les enfants tout \u00e9veill\u00e9s.\r\nPour cela, ils leur font dessiner des d\u00e9cors incroyables et les projettent sur sc\u00e8ne afin de jouer dedans.\r\n\u00ab Maintenant, ils se souviendront de nous ! \u00bb","performers":"M\u00e9lissa Motheu, Thierry Maerschalk, Hicham El Hamouri","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.improviste.be\/Prete-Moi-Ton-Reve.html","email":"info@improviste.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.539470"},"nl":{"name":"Pr\u00eate-moi ton r\u00eave","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":"info@improviste.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.539470"},"en":{"name":"Pr\u00eate-moi ton r\u00eave","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":"info@improviste.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.539470"},"de":{"name":"Pr\u00eate-moi ton r\u00eave","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.539470"},"it":{"name":"Pr\u00eate-moi ton r\u00eave","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.539470"},"sp":{"name":"Pr\u00eate-moi ton r\u00eave","shortdes