m\u00e8re, un peu juive, attend son fils.\r\nTant\u00f4t acide, Tant\u00f4t dr\u00f4le, souvent touchante,\r\nSon inqui\u00e9tude se m\u00e9lange \u00e0 ses r\u00e9flexions et ses souvenirs.\r\nS\u2019invitent \u00e0 son insomnie, des personnages pittoresques et attachants.\r\n\r\nR\u00e9flexions nocturnes d'une maman qui attend son fils adolescent qui n'est pas rentr\u00e9.","longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":"reservations4h20@gmail.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.546127"},"nl":{"name":"4u20","shortdescr":"Alleen in de achterkamer van haar apotheek,\r\nEen moeder, een beetje Joods, wacht op haar zoon.\r\nSoms zuur, soms grappig, vaak ontroerend,\r\nHaar angst vermengt zich met haar gedachten en herinneringen.\r\nSchilderachtige en innemende personages nodigen zichzelf uit tot haar slapeloze nachten.\r\n\r\nNachtelijk piekeren van een moeder die wacht op haar tienerzoon die \u2018s nachts nog niet is teruggekeerd.","longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":"reservations4h20@gmail.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.546127"},"en":{"name":"4:20 AM","shortdescr":"Alone in the back room of her pharmacy,\r\nA mother, a little Jewish, waits for her son.\r\nSometimes bitter, sometimes funny, often touching,\r\nHer anxiety mixes with her thoughts and memories.\r\nPicturesque and endearing characters invite themselves in her sleepless nights.\r\n\r\nNightly thoughts of a mother waiting for her teenage son who hasn't come home.","longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":"reservations4h20@gmail.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.546127"},"de":{"name":"4h20","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers