 by the cosiest alpine stations","longdescr":"Autre nouveaut\u00e9 de saison, un v\u00e9ritable chalet alpin prendra place sur la vaste terrasse du Wiltcher\u2019s. On y acc\u00e8dera par la Christmas Forest et \u00e0 l\u2019entr\u00e9e une bo\u00eete aux lettres y sera install\u00e9e pour que tous les enfants de passage puissent y d\u00e9poser leurs lettres au p\u00e8re No\u00ebl. Dans une d\u00e9coration, elle aussi, des plus f\u00e9\u00e9riques, les plus grands pourront y d\u00e9guster, en principal atout, diff\u00e9rents crus de Champagne TAITTINGER. Bien entendu, les talents des mixologues de l\u2019h\u00f4tel seront eux aussi joyeusement mis \u00e0 contribution pour des cocktails cr\u00e9ations","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.steigenberger.com\/hotels\/alle-hotels\/belgien\/bruessel\/steigenberger-wiltchers","email":null,"phone_contact":"+32 2 542 42 42","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.546754"},"nl":{"name":"The Wiltcher\u2019s Winter Terrasse \u2013 Chalet TAITTINGER","shortdescr":"A cosy winter terrasse with a chalet inspired by the cosiest alpine stations","longdescr":"Ook nieuw deze eindejaarsperiode is een heus Alpenchalet op het grote terras van Wiltcher's. Het zal toegankelijk zijn via het Christmas Forest en bij de ingang zal een brievenbus worden geplaatst zodat alle passerende kinderen hun brieven aan de Kerstman kunnen afgeven. In een sprookjesachtige decor zullen de grootsten verschillende jaargangen van de TAITTINGER Champagne kunnen proeven. Uiteraard zullen ook de getalenteerde cocktailmakers van het hotel worden ingezet om lekkere cocktails te maken.","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.546754"},"en":{"name":"The Wiltcher\u2019s Winter Terrasse \u2013 Chalet TAITTINGER","shortdescr":"A cosy winter terrasse with a chalet inspired by the cosiest alpine stations","longdescr":"Another seasonal novelty, a real Alpine chalet will occupy the vast terrace of the Wiltcher\u2019s. It will be accessed via the Christmas Forest and, at the entrance, there will be a post box so that all the passing children can post their letters to Santa. Amidst the equally enchanting d\u00e9cor, the main attraction for older visitors will be the tasting of different vintages of TAITTINGER Champagne. Of course, the talents of the hotel\u2019s mixologists will also be happily stirred up for some creative cocktails.","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.546754"},"de":{"name":"The Wiltcher\u2019s Winter Terrasse \u2013 Chalet TAITTINGER","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.546754"},"it":{"name":"The Wiltcher\u2019s Winter Terrasse \u2013 Chalet TAITTINGER","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.546754"},"sp":{"name":"The Wiltcher\u2019s Winter Terrasse \u2013 Chalet TAITTINGER","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.546754"},"pt":{"name":"The Wiltcher\u2019s Winter Terrasse \u2013 Chalet TAITTINGER","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.546754