ofessionnel Fahem Abes, venez d\u00e9couvrir le mus\u00e9e de la Porte de Hal sous un angle in\u00e9dit !","longdescr":"Guid\u00e9.e.s par le conteur professionnel Fahem Abes, venez d\u00e9couvrir le mus\u00e9e de la Porte de Hal sous un angle in\u00e9dit !\r\n\r\nDurant ce parcours cont\u00e9, accompagn\u00e9 de son ukul\u00e9l\u00e9, de sa fl\u00fbte am\u00e9rindienne ou plac\u00e9 \u00e0 c\u00f4t\u00e9 de son Kamishiba\u00ef, Fahem vous partagera certains contes de son r\u00e9pertoire. Ceux-ci entreront en r\u00e9sonance particuli\u00e8re avec les murs de la tour de la Porte de Hal, vestige de l\u2019enceinte m\u00e9di\u00e9val qui entourait autrefois Bruxelles.\u00a0\r\n\r\nEmbarquez pour un voyage exceptionnel, en paroles et en musique, dans le monde de la tradition orale.\r\n\r\nDans le cadre du projet\u00a0\u00a0\u00ab Contes et muse\u0301es \u00bb initie\u0301 par la Fe\u0301de\u0301ration des conteurs professionnels.\u00a0\r\n\r\nPlus d'infos ?\u00a0Envoyez votre question \u00e0\u00a0public@kmkg-mrah.be\u00a0","performers":"Fahem Abes","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.portedehal.be","email":"portedehal@mrah.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 534 15 18","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.547527"},"nl":{"name":"Contes au mus\u00e9e : Les murs de la tour","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.547527"},"en":{"name":"Contes au mus\u00e9e : Les murs de la tour","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.547527"},"de":{"name":"Contes au mus\u00e9e : Les murs de la tour","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.547527"},"it":{"name":"Contes au mus\u00e9e : Les murs de la tour","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.547527"},"sp":{"name":"Contes au mus\u00e9e : Les murs de la tour","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.547527"},"pt":{"name":"Contes au mus\u00e9e : Les murs de la tour","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.547527"},"cn":{"name":"Contes au mus\u00e9e : Les murs de la tour","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.547527"}},"place":{"id":61,"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Mus\u00e9e Art & Histoire (MRAH)","address_street_name":"Parc du Cinquantenaire","address_street_number":"10","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@mrah.be","website":"https:\/\/www.artandhistory.museum","phone_contact":"+32 2 741 73 31","phone_booking":"+32 2 741 73 02","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Parc du Cinquantenaire, 10","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Embarquez pour un fascinant voyage \u00e0 travers l'art et l'histoire. Venez fl\u00e2ner parmi les momies \u00e9gyptiennes et les silex pr\u00e9historiques, vous promener entre les verres anciens et prendre du recul pour mieux contempler d'impressionnantes tapisseries m\u00e9di\u00e9vales. Venez vous immerger dans le monde oriental en croisant des Bouddhas d'Asie et voyager jusqu'\u00e0 l'autre bout de la terre pour apercevoir une gigantesque statue de l'\u00eele de P\u00e2ques. La magnifique collection d'Art Nouveau vous attend au bout du voyage.\r\nLe Mus\u00e9e Art & Histoire fait partie des Mus\u00e9es royaux d\u2019Art et d\u2019Histoire, appellation qui chapeaute, outre le Mus\u00e9e Art & Histoire, le mim (Mus\u00e9e des Instruments de Musique), la Porte de Hal et les Mus\u00e9es d\u2019Extr\u00eame-Orient actuellement ferm\u00e9s.\r\n\r\n\r\nLe Mus\u00e9e Art & Histoire fait partie des Mus\u00e9es royaux d\u2019Art et d\u2019Histoire, appellation qui chapeaute, outre le Mus\u00e9e Art & Histoire, le mim (Mus\u00e9e des Instruments de Musique), la Porte de Hal et les Mus\u00e9es d\u2019Extr\u00eame-Orient actuellement ferm\u00e9s. ","description_print":"Le Mus\u00e9e du Cinquantenaire illustre les activit\u00e9s humaines et artistiques des cinq continents \u2013 hormis l\u2019Afrique noire \u2013, de la Pr\u00e9histoire \u00e0 nos jours. Les collections remplissent quatre b\u00e2timents et sont regroup\u00e9es en quatre d\u00e9partements: l\u2019Antiquit\u00e9, les civilisations extra-europ\u00e9ennes, l\u2019arch\u00e9ologie nationale et les arts d\u00e9coratifs europ\u00e9ens.","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"Museum Kunst & Geschiedenis (KMKG)","address_street_name":"Jubelpark","address_street_number":"10","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@kmkg.be","website":"https:\/\/www.artandhistory.museum","phone_contact":"+32 2 741 73 31","phone_booking":"+32 2 741 73 02","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussel","address_line1":"Jubelpark, 10","address_line2":"1000 Brussel","description_web":"Maak een wereldreis door de geschiedenis! Wandel van prehistorische vuistbijlen naar Egyptische mummies. Snuistert tussen betoverende glas en zet een stap achteruit om de indrukwekkende Brusselse wandtapijten te bekijken. Ga de oosterse toer op tussen de Aziatische boeddha\u2019s en steek de Atlantische Oceaan over om Kuifjes \u2018beeldje met het gebroken oor\u2019. En dan is er nog de mooie collectie van Belgische art nouveau\u2026 U komt ogen en oren te kort!\r\n\r\nHet Museum Kunst & Geschiedenis maakt deel uit van de Koninklijke Musea voor Kunst en Geschiedenis (KMKG) die ook het Muziekinstrumentenmuseum (MIM), de Hallepoort en de Musea van het Verre Oosten (gesloten voor renovatie) bundelen.","description_print":"Het Jubelparkmuseum kan bogen op een imposante collectie kunstschatten en archeologische vondsten afkomstig uit de vijf continenten \u2013 met uitzondering van Zwart-Afrika \u2013 van de prehistorie tot op heden. De verzamelingen vullen vier gebouwen en zijn ingedeeld in evenveel departementen: Oudheid (het Nabije Oosten, Egypte, Griekenland, Rome en Byzantium), Niet-Europese Beschavingen (Islam, Azi\u00eb, Polynesi\u00eb & Micronesi\u00eb en Amerika), Nationale Archeologie en Europese Sierkunsten.","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"Art & History Museum (RMAH)","address_street_name":"Parc du Cinquantenaire","address_street_number":"10","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@mrah.be","website":"https:\/\/www.artandhistory.museum","phone_contact":"+32 2 741 73 31","phone_booking":"+32 2 741 73 02","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussels","address_line1":"Parc du Cinquantenaire, 10","address_line2":"1000 Brussels","description_web":"Embark on a fascinating journey through art and history! Come and stroll among the prehistoric flints and Egyptian mummies, walk between the ancient glasses and stand back to contemplate the impressive medieval tapestries. Immerse yourself in the oriental world as you pass Asian Buddhas and travel to the other side of the world to see a gigantic statue from Easter Island. You still have to admire the magnificent collection of Belgian Art Nouveau...\r\n\r\nThe Art & History Museum is part of the Royal Museums of Art and History (RMAH) that also cover the Musical Instruments Museum (MIM), Halle Gate and the Museums of the Far East (currently closed for renovation).","description_print":"The Cinquantenaire Museum is the headquarters of the Royal Museums of Art and History. It was erected at the end of the nineteenth century and is one of the most extensive museums in Belgium. The collections are divided according to four main themes: 1) National Archaeology; 2) Antiquity; 3) European Decorative Art; 4) Non-European Civilizations.","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"de":{"name":"Mus\u00e9e Art & Histoire (MRAH)","address_street_name":"Parc du Cinquantenaire","address_street_number":"10","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@mrah.be","website":"https:\/\/www.artandhistory.museum","phone_contact":"+32 2 741 73 31","phone_booking":"+32 2 741 73 02","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Parc du Cinquantenaire, 10","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Das Cinquantenaire-Museum, gelegen im Br\u00fcsseler Jubelpark, ist Teil der K\u00f6niglichen Museen f\u00fcr Kunst und Geschichte und bietet einen umfassenden und vielseitigen \u00dcberblick \u00fcber die Geschichte von den Hochkulturen der Antike bis hin zu den Kunststr\u00f6mungen der Gegenwart.\r\n\r\nAntike Sammlungen: \r\nDie antiken Sammlungen befassen sich mit den untergegangenen Hochkulturen von \u00c4gypten (Neuheit: das Grabmal von Nakht), Mesopotamien, Griechenland und Rom. Gezeigt werden au\u00dferdem die gro\u00dfen Kunststr\u00f6mungen Europas vom 10. Jahrhundert bis heute. Wandteppiche, Altaraufs\u00e4tze, Spitze, Goldschmiedekunst und Porzellan geh\u00f6ren zu den kostbaren H\u00f6hepunkten der Ausstellung.\r\n\r\nVon Mikronesien bis Amerika: \r\nDie nicht-europ\u00e4ischen Werke laden ihrerseits auf eine Reise ein: nach Mikronesien, Polynesien, Indien, S\u00fcdostasien, China und ins pr\u00e4kolumbische Amerika. In den eindrucksvollen Arch\u00e4ologie-S\u00e4len wird der Geschichte der Region von der Vorgeschichte bis zur Epoche der Merowinger neues Leben eingehaucht.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"it":{"name":"Museo Arte & Historia","address_street_name":"Parc du Cinquantenaire","address_street_number":"10","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@mrah.be","website":"https:\/\/www.artandhistory.museum","phone_contact":"+32 2 741 73 31","phone_booking":"+32 2 741 73 02","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Parc du Cinquantenaire, 10","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Situato nel cuore del complesso del Cinquantenario, il Mus\u00e9e du Cinquantenaire vi invita a viaggiatore attraverso i continenti dalla Preistoria al XX secolo. \r\n\r\n\r\nLe sue ricche collezioni sono suddivise in quattro grandi sezioni :\r\n\r\n- L'Antichit\u00e0 dove sono presentate le grandi civilt\u00e0 scomparse dell'Egitto, della Mesopotamia, della Grecia e di Roma.\r\n- Le Arti decorative europee dove scoprire le correnti artistiche dal X secolo ai giorni nostri.\r\n- Le Civilt\u00e0 non europee che invitano al viaggio: India, Sudest asiatico, Cina, America precolombiana.\r\n- L'archeologia nazionale per rivivere il passato delle nostre regioni, dalla Preistoria al periodo merovingio.\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"sp":{"name":"Museo de Arte e Historia","address_street_name":"Parc du Cinquantenaire","address_street_number":"10","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@mrah.be","website":"https:\/\/www.artandhistory.museum","phone_contact":"+32 2 741 73 31","phone_booking":"+32 2 741 73 02","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Parc du Cinquantenaire, 10","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Ad\u00e9ntrate en este edificio hist\u00f3rico, uno de los mayores museos de B\u00e9lgica erigido por el anterior rey belga Leopoldo II. Descubre una gran cantidad de objetos desde la prehistoria hasta la antig\u00fcedad y de las artes aplicadas europeas hasta una amplia colecci\u00f3n de arte no europea. Explora todo, incluyendo las interesantes exposiciones temporales, conferencias y otras actividades. Desafortunadamente, la p\u00e1gina web no es tan amplia como para mostrar toda nuestra colecci\u00f3n, compuesta por miles de tesoros del arte y objetos hist\u00f3ricos. Sin embargo, esperamos que nos visites y disfrutes descubriendo o redescubriendo el inmenso patrimonio que gestionamos y exhibimos. De hecho, para nosotros el arte y la historia no son muerte y temas pasados, si no una viva y constante fuente de inspiraci\u00f3n y diversi\u00f3n.\r\n\r\nEl Museo de Arte e Historia es parte de los Museos Reales de Arte e Historia(MRAH), que incluye el Museo de Instrumentos Musicales(MIM), la Puerta de Hal y los Museos del Lejano Oriente(recientemente cerrado por renovaciones).\r\n\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"pt":{"name":"Museu de Arte e Hist\u00f3ria (MRAH)","address_street_name":"Parc du Cinquantenaire","address_street_number":"10","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@mrah.be","website":"https:\/\/www.artandhistory.museum","phone_contact":"+32 2 741 73 31","phone_booking":"+32 2 741 73 02","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Parc du Cinquantenaire, 10","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Da arqueologia nacional \u00e0s artes decorativas europeias, passando pela antiguidade cl\u00e1ssica e pelas civiliza\u00e7\u00f5es n\u00e3o europeias, embarque numa fascinante viagem atrav\u00e9s da arte e da hist\u00f3ria num edif\u00edcio magn\u00edfico criado por L\u00e9opold II no parque do Cinquenten\u00e1rio em Bruxelas.\r\n\r\n-  Museu do Cinquenten\u00e1rio muda de pele e torna-se o Museu de Arte e Hist\u00f3ria!\r\n-  Museu do Cinquenten\u00e1rio desenvolveu um trabalho de reflex\u00e3o sobre a sua imagem. Este resultou numa campanha de reorganiza\u00e7\u00e3o global da institui\u00e7\u00e3o. Come\u00e7ou assim uma reconquista museogr\u00e1fica: a decis\u00e3o de organizar exposi\u00e7\u00f5es tempor\u00e1rias baseadas nas pr\u00f3prias cole\u00e7\u00f5es do museu e de renovar progressivamente as salas permanentes, come\u00e7ando pelo armaz\u00e9m Wolfers, que foi a primeira etapa de uma s\u00e9rie de outras renova\u00e7\u00f5es (salas Egito, salas s\u00e9culos XIX e XX, maqueta de Roma\u2026) que atingem rapidamente a sua velocidade de cruzeiro. O\r\n- Museu de Arte e Hist\u00f3ria pertence aos Museus Reais de Arte e da Hist\u00f3ria, que englobam, para al\u00e9m deste, o MIM (Museu dos Instrumentos Musicais), a Porta de Hal e os Museus do Extremo Oriente, atualmente encerrados.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"cn":{"name":"Mus\u00e9e Art & Histoire (MRAH)","address_street_name":"Parc du Cinquantenaire","address_street_number":"10","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@mrah.be","website":"https:\/\/www.artandhistory.museum","phone_contact":"+32 2 741 73 31","phone_booking":"+32 2 741 73 02","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Parc du Cinquantenaire, 10","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null}},"districts":{"list":[9],"translations":{"fr":["Quartier europ\u00e9en"],"nl":["Europese wijk"],"en":["European Quarter"],"de":["Europ\u00e4isches Viertel"],"it":[null],"sp":[null],"pt":[null],"cn":[null]}},"zones":{"list":[22],"translations":{"fr":["Est"],"nl":["Oost"],"en":["East"],"de":["Osten"],"it":[null],"sp":[null],"pt":[null],"cn":[null]}},"neca":null,"facebook_id":null,"backoffice_id":12,"location":{"lat":50.83935087,"lon":4.3917188},"region":"brussels","last_updated_at":"2022-12-16T20:35:08+01:00","published_at":"2013-10-19T01:13:13+02:00","import_origin":null,"external_id":null,"is_in_address_book":true,"is_in_vb_export":true,"resto_ranking":0},"organizer":{"id":203657,"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Porte de Hal - MRAH","address_street_name":"Boulevard du Midi","address_street_number":"150","address_street_box":null,"email":"portedehal@mrah.be","website":"http:\/\/www.portedehal.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 534 15 18","phone_booking":"+32 2 533 34 51","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Boulevard du Midi, 150","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Ce monument f\u00e9erique, vieux de plus de 600 ans, constitue le t\u00e9moin le plus remarquable du pass\u00e9 m\u00e9di\u00e9val de la ville.\r\nDernier vestige de la seconde enceinte de Bruxelles, la porte de Hal accueille aujourd\u2019hui une belle collection d\u2019\u0153uvres et de multiples supports didactiques mettant en lumi\u00e8re son histoire et celle des fortifications bruxelloises. La fa\u00e7ade n\u00e9ogothique et la haute toiture ajout\u00e9es par l\u2019architecte Henry Beyaert au XIXe si\u00e8cle n\u2019ont rien enlev\u00e9 \u00e0 la splendeur des salles m\u00e9di\u00e9vales \u00e0 l\u2019int\u00e9rieur du b\u00e2timent. Au sommet de la tour, depuis le chemin de ronde cr\u00e9nel\u00e9, vous pourrez profiter d\u2019un spectaculaire panorama sur Bruxelles et sa r\u00e9gion. Une visite id\u00e9ale pour enfants et adultes.","description_print":"Ce monument f\u00e9\u00e9rique, vieux de plus de 600 ans, constitue le t\u00e9moin le plus remarquable du pass\u00e9 m\u00e9di\u00e9val de la ville. Dernier vestige de la seconde enceinte de Bruxelles, la porte de Hal accueille aujourd\u2019hui une belle collection d\u2019\u0153uvres et de multiples supports didactiques mettant en lumi\u00e8re son histoire et celle des fortifications bruxelloises. La fa\u00e7ade n\u00e9ogothique et la haute toiture ajout\u00e9es par l\u2019architecte Henry Beyaert au XIXe si\u00e8cle n\u2019ont rien enlev\u00e9 \u00e0 la splendeur des salles m\u00e9di\u00e9vales \u00e0 l\u2019int\u00e9rieur du b\u00e2timent. Au sommet de la tour, depuis le chemin de ronde cr\u00e9nel\u00e9, vous pourrez profiter d\u2019un spectaculaire panorama sur Bruxelles et sa r\u00e9gion. Une visite id\u00e9ale pour enfants et adultes.","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"Hallepoort \u2013 KMKG","address_street_name":"Zuidlaan","address_street_number":"150","address_street_box":null,"email":"portedehal@mrah.be","website":"http:\/\/www.hallepoortmuseum.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 534 15 18","phone_booking":"+32 2 533 34 51","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussel","address_line1":"Zuidlaan, 150","address_line2":"1000 Brussel","description_web":"De Hallepoort is een sprookjesachtig monument, meer dan 600 jaar oud en de meest opmerkelijke getuige van het middeleeuwse verleden van de stad Brussel.\r\nDe Hallepoort is het laatste overblijfsel van de tweede omwalling van Brussel. Vandaag vind je er een prachtige collectie kunstwerken en vele didactische hulpmiddelen rond de geschiedenis van de Brusselse omwallingen en de stedelijke ambachtsgilden.\r\nDe neogotische fa\u00e7ade en het hoge dak, toegevoegd door architect Henry Beyaert in de 19de eeuw hebben niets afgedaan aan de pracht van de middeleeuwse zalen binnenin het gebouw.\r\nBoven op de toren kan je genieten van een spectaculair panorama over Brussel en omgeving.\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"Halle Gate \u2013 RMAH","address_street_name":"Boulevard du Midi","address_street_number":"150","address_street_box":null,"email":"portedehal@mrah.be","website":"http:\/\/www.kmkg-mrah.be\/halle-gate","phone_contact":"+32 2 534 15 18","phone_booking":"+32 2 533 34 51","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussels","address_line1":"Boulevard du Midi, 150","address_line2":"1000 Brussels","description_web":"This last preserved gate will catapult you centuries back. An interactive tour through the striking rooms of the 14th century city gate will reveal how Brussels defended itself against external attacks during the Middle Ages and present the role that townspeople played in defence of their city. Visitors will gain a better understanding of the medieval city and its impact on present-day metropolitan Brussels by trying on a piece of armour, checking out models and short films,  exploring multimedia activities or just simply admiring the beautiful selection of museum pieces.\r\nAnd, the changing temporary exhibits on past and current life in the city are always a great reason to return to the Halle Gate. Best of all, the crenellated walkway around the top of the monument offers a spectacular view of the sprawling capital.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"de":{"name":"Porte de Hal - K\u00f6nigliche Museen f\u00fcr Kunst und Geschichte","address_street_name":"Boulevard du Midi","address_street_number":"150","address_street_box":null,"email":"portedehal@mrah.be","website":"http:\/\/www.portedehal.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 534 15 18","phone_booking":"+32 2 533 34 51","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Boulevard du Midi, 150","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Das ehemalige Stadttor Porte de Hal ist einer der bemerkenswertesten Zeugen der mittelalterlichen Vergangenheit Br\u00fcssels: Es handelt sich um das einzige noch erhaltene Tor der sieben Stadttore der mittelalterlichen Festungsmauern.\r\n\r\nFestung mit bewegter Vergangenheit: Das heute wie eine verwunschene Burg anmutende Geb\u00e4ude blickt auf eine bewegte Geschichte zur\u00fcck und war mehrfach vom Abriss bedroht: Nach der milit\u00e4rischen Funktion bis zum Jahr 1564 folgten verschiedenste Arten der Nutzung - unter anderem als lutherische Kirche, als Kontrollstelle f\u00fcr die Wareneinfuhr und -ausfuhr, als Kornspeicher und als Archiv! \r\n\r\nDas Museum Porte de Hal: 1847 wird das Geb\u00e4ude erstmals als Museum genutzt, 1860 wird der Architekt Henri Beyaert offiziell mit dem Umbau beauftragt: Er nimmt tiefgreifende bauliche Ver\u00e4nderungen und Neuinterpretation im neogotischen Stil vor. Vorherrschend ist die romantische Vision eines mittelalterlichen Bauwerks mit T\u00fcrmchen, Zinnen, Scharten, Verzierungen und verschiedenen dekorativen Elementen. \r\n\r\nHeute verbirgt sich hinter der renovierten wei\u00dfen Fassade das Museum \u201eMus\u00e9e du Porte de Hal\" mit Sammlungen \u00fcber das mittelalterliche Br\u00fcssel und die Geschichte des Geb\u00e4udes, die naturgem\u00e4\u00df eng miteinander verkn\u00fcpft sind. \r\n\r\nBesonderer Tipp: Vom Turm aus haben Sie einen fantastischen Ausblick auf Br\u00fcssel. \r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"it":{"name":"Porte de Hal - Musei Reali d'Arte e Storia, Bruxelles","address_street_name":"Boulevard du Midi","address_street_number":"150","address_street_box":null,"email":"portedehal@mrah.be","website":"http:\/\/www.portedehal.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 534 15 18","phone_booking":"+32 2 533 34 51","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Boulevard du Midi, 150","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Edificio che risale a oltre 600 anni fa in stile neogotico ottimamente conservato, la Porte de hal \u00e8 il monumento pi\u00f9 importante del passato medievale della citt\u00e0.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nEdificio che risale a oltre 600 anni fa in stile neogotico ottimamente conservato, la Porte de hal \u00e8 il monumento pi\u00f9 importante del passato medievale della citt\u00e0.\u00a0Si tratta dell'unica porta fortificata della seconda cinta delle\u00a0mura Bruxelles.\r\n\r\nLa funzione di prigione la risparmi\u00f2 dalla demolizione delle porte del XVIII secolo. Tuttavia, nel 1869, l'architetto Beyaert realizz\u00f2 alcune modifiche alterandone l'aspetto iniziale che nulla tolgono allo splendore delle sale medievali interne.\u00a0Dall'alto della torre si gode un bel<b> panorama su Bruxelles.\u00a0\r\n\r\nLa Porte de Hal oggi accoglie una bella collezione di opere che, con l'aiuto di supporti didattici, mettono in luce la sua storia e quella delle fortificazioni brussellesi.\u00a0\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"sp":{"name":"Puerta de Hal - MRAH","address_street_name":"Boulevard du Midi","address_street_number":"150","address_street_box":null,"email":"portedehal@mrah.be","website":"https:\/\/www.laguiadeviaje.com\/puerta-de-hal\/","phone_contact":"+32 2 534 15 18","phone_booking":"+32 2 533 34 51","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Boulevard du Midi, 150","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"La Puerta de Hal, en los Museos Reales de Arte y de Historia, es un monumento de m\u00e1s de 600 a\u00f1os, que constituye el testigo m\u00e1s destacado del medievo en Bruselas.\u00a0\r\n\r\nLa Puerta de Hal, en los Museos Reales de Arte y de Historia, es un monumento de m\u00e1s de 600 a\u00f1os, que constituye el testigo m\u00e1s destacado del medievo en Bruselas.\r\n\r\n\u00daltimo vestigio de la segunda muralla de Bruselas, la Puerta de Hal, alberga a fecha de hoy una magn\u00edfica colecci\u00f3n de obras de arte y m\u00faltiples soportes did\u00e1cticos, que ponen de relieve su historia y la de las fortificaciones bruselenses.\u00a0\r\n\r\nLa fachada neog\u00f3tica y los altos techos a\u00f1adidos por el arquitecto Henry Beyaert en el s. XIX no han acabado con el esplendor de las salas medievales en el interior del edificio.\r\n\r\nEn lo alto de la torre, desde el camino de ronda almenado, podr\u00e1s disfrutar de unas vistas espectaculares de Bruselas y de su regi\u00f3n.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"pt":{"name":"Porte de Hal - MRAH","address_street_name":"Boulevard du Midi","address_street_number":"150","address_street_box":null,"email":"portedehal@mrah.be","website":"http:\/\/www.portedehal.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 534 15 18","phone_booking":"+32 2 533 34 51","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Boulevard du Midi, 150","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"cn":{"name":"Porte de Hal - MRAH","address_street_name":"Boulevard du Midi","address_street_number":"150","address_street_box":null,"email":"portedehal@mrah.be","website":"http:\/\/www.portedehal.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 534 15 18","phone_booking":"+32 2 533 34 51","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Boulevard du Midi, 150","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null}},"neca":null,"facebook_id":null,"backoffice_id":414,"location":{"lat":50.83309758,"lon":4.34491654},"region":"brussels","last_updated_at":"2022-12-16T20:35:08+01:00","published_at":"2013-10-19T01:13:30+02:00","import_origin":null,"external_id":null,"is_in_address_book":true,"is_in_vb_export":true,"resto_ranking":0},"media":[{"type":"photo","link":"https:\/\/agendabrussels.imgix.net\/16a11e94c82c080b4abea2e82abbe69297d22b87.jpg","width":1640,"height":856,"ratio":1.92,"translations":{"fr":{"title":"Contes au mus\u00e9e : Les murs de la tour","copyright":"Contes au mus\u00e9e"},"nl":{"title":"Contes au mus\u00e9e : Les murs de la tour","copyright":"Contes au mus\u00e9e"},"en":{"title":"Contes au mus\u00e9e : Les murs de la tour","copyright":"Contes au mus\u00e9e"},"de":{"title":"Contes au mus\u00e9e : Les murs de la tour","copyright":"Contes au mus\u00e9e"},"it":{"title":"Contes au mus\u00e9e : Les murs de la tour","copyright":"Contes au mus\u00e9e"},"sp":{"title":"Contes au mus\u00e9e : Les murs de la tour","copyright":"Contes au mus\u00e9e"},"pt":{"title":"Contes au mus\u00e9e : Les murs de la tour","copyright":"Contes au mus\u00e9e"},"cn":{"title":"Contes au mus\u00e9e : Les murs de la tour","copyright":"Contes au mus\u00e9e"}}}],"dates":[{"day":"2023-01-03","doors":"14:00:00","start":"14:00:00","end":"15:15:00","is_soldout":false,"is_canceled":false},{"day":"2023-01-04","doors":"14:00:00","start":"14:00:00","end":"15:15:00","is_soldout":false,"is_canceled":false},{"day":"2023-01-05","doors":"14:00:00","start":"14:00:00","end":"15:15:00","is_soldout":false,"is_canceled":false}],"prices":[{"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Enfants"},"nl":{"name":"Kinderen"},"en":{"name":"Children"},"de":{"name":"Kinder"},"it":{"name":"Enfants"},"sp":{"name":"Enfants"},"pt":{"name":"Enfants"},"cn":{"name":"Enfants"}},"value":3},{"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Normal"},"nl":{"name":"Normaal"},"en":{"name":"Normal"},"de":{"name":"Normal"},"it":{"name":"Normal"},"sp":{"name":"Normal"},"pt":{"name":"Normal"},"cn":{"name":"Normal"}},"value":10},{"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Seniors"},"nl":{"name":"Senioren"},"en":{"name":"Seniors"},"de":{"name":"Senioren"},"it":{"name":"Seniors"},"sp":{"name":"Seniors"},"pt":{"name":"Seniors"},"cn":{"name":"Seniors"}},"value":8},{"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Etudiants"},"nl":{"name":"Studenten"},"en":{"name":"Students"},"de":{"name":"Studierende"},"it":{"name":"Etudiants"},"sp":{"name":"Etudiants"},"pt":{"name":"Etudiants"},"cn":{"name":"Etudiants"}},"value":6}],"child_events":[],"parent_events":[],"targets":{"list":[4,5,7],"translations":{"fr":["Enfants 6-9 ans","Enfants 9-12 ans","Jeunes 12-15 ans"],"nl":["Kinderen 6-9 j.","Kinderen 9-12 j.","Jongeren 12-15 j."],"en":["Children 6-9 yr.","Children 9-12 yr.","Youth 12-15  yr."],"de":["Kinder 6-9 Jahre","Kinder 9-12 Jahre","Jugendliche 12-15 Jahre"],"it":[null,null,null],"sp":[null,null,null],"pt":[null,null,null],"cn":[null,null,null]}},"tags":["kids"],"accessibilities":{"list":[255,259,261,263,265],"translations":{"fr":["Accessible","Chien d'assistance","Parking accessible","Accessible aux pi\u00e9tons appareill\u00e9s","WC adapt\u00e9"],"nl":["Toegankelijk","Assistentiehonden","Toegankelijke parking","Toegankelijk voor voetgangers met hulpmiddelen","Aangepast toilet"],"en":["Accessible","Assistance dogs","Accessible parking","Accessible to pedestrians with mobility aids","Adapted toilet"],"de":["Barrierefrei","Assistenzhund","Barrierefreier Parkplatz","Barrierefrei f\u00fcr Fu\u00dfg\u00e4nger mit Gehhilfe","Barrierefreies WC"],"it":[null,null,null,null,null],"sp":[null,null,null,null,null],"pt":[null,null,null,null,null],"cn":[null,null,null,null,null]}},"facebook_link":null,"publication_state":"public","last_updated_at":"2022-12-16T20:35:08+01:00","published_at":"2022-12-16T20:13:28+01:00","backoffice_id":267527,"import_origin":null,"sub_type":"theatre","show_in_agenda":true,"ranking":0.8735804647363},{"id":546800,"date_start":"2022-12-22","date_end":"2023-01-08","date_next":"2023-01-03","accept_article27":true,"accept_cultuurbon":false,"accept_paspartoe":false,"is_closed_on_public_holidays":false,"is_closed_on_school_holidays":false,"is_only_by_appointment":false,"is_permanent":false,"is_free":false,"is_online":false,"is_canceled":false,"is_soldout":false,"categories":{"main":{"id":23,"translations":{"fr":"Exposition","nl":"Tentoonstellingen","en":"Exhibition","de":"Ausstellung","it":null,"sp":null,"pt":null,"cn":null}},"others":{"list":[36,38],"translations":{"fr":["Mus\u00e9es et art centers","Sculpture"],"nl":["Musea en kunstcentra","Beeldhouwkunst"],"en":["Museums and art centers","Sculpture"],"de":["Museen & Kunstzentren","Skulptur"],"it":[null,null],"sp":[null,null],"pt":[null,null],"cn":[null,null]}}},"languages":{"spoken":["fr","nl","en"],"subtitles":[]},"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Can for Balkan","shortdescr":"Can for Balkan? Yes we can!","longdescr":"Les pays des Balkans et leurs habitants sont souvent st\u00e9r\u00e9otyp\u00e9s dans les BD. L'exposition \"Can for Balkan\" vous emm\u00e8ne non seulement dans ce monde de st\u00e9r\u00e9otypes, mais aussi dans l'histoire des Balkans et leur culture de la BD. En outre, l'exposition propose \u00e9galement une vision artistique contemporaine de l'histoire de ces r\u00e9gions \u00e0 travers 64 bandes dessin\u00e9es originales cr\u00e9\u00e9es par pas moins de 67 artistes. \r\n\r\nLeurs travaux ont \u00e9t\u00e9 s\u00e9lectionn\u00e9s dans le cadre d'un concours international.\r\nCan For Balkan est un projet europ\u00e9en issu de l\u2019appel : \"Renforcer la coop\u00e9ration culturelle et la comp\u00e9titivit\u00e9 des industries culturelles et cr\u00e9atives dans les Balkans occidentaux\".","performers":"Nicolae Pepene (concept, commissariat, graphisme, sc\u00e9nographie), Octav Ungureanu (graphisme), Mihai Ungureanu (graphisme), Cosmin Vi\u0219an (graphisme), Gy\u00f6rgy Szigy\u00e1rt\u00f3 (graphisme), Octavian Boldijar (graphisme), Cristi Farca\u0219 (animations vid\u00e9o), Ovidiu Coci\u0219 (animations vid\u00e9o), Octav Ungureanu (animations vid\u00e9o)","boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.546800"},"nl":{"name":"Can for Balkan","shortdescr":"Can for Balkan? Yes we can!","longdescr":"In strips worden landen uit de Balkan en de mensen die er wonen vaak stereotiep afgebeeld. De tentoonstelling 'Can for Balkan' neemt je niet alleen mee in die wereld van stereotypering, maar ook in de geschiedenis van de Balkan en zijn stripcultuur. Daarnaast biedt de tentoonstelling ook een hedendaagse artistieke kijk op de geschiedenis van de regio aan de hand van 64 originele strips gemaakt door niet minder dan 67 kunstenaars. Hun werk werd geselecteerd in het kader van een internationale wedstrijd.\r\n\r\nCan For Balkan is een Europees project in het kader van de open call \"Versterking van de culturele samenwerking met en het concurrentievermogen van de culturele en creatieve industrie\u00ebn in de Westelijke Balkan\".","performers":"Nicolae Pepene (concept, curator, grafisch ontwerp, scenografie), Octav Ungureanu (grafisch ontwerp), Mihai Ungureanu (grafisch ontwerp), Cosmin Vi\u0219an (grafisch ontwerp), Gy\u00f6rgy Szigy\u00e1rt\u00f3 (grafisch ontwerp), Octavian Boldijar (grafisch ontwerp), Cristi Farca\u0219 (video-animaties), Ovidiu Coci\u0219 (video-animaties), Octav Ungureanu (video-animaties )","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.stripmuseum.be","email":"visit@stripmuseum.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 219 19 80","phone_booking":"+32 2 219 19 80","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.546800"},"en":{"name":"Can for Balkan","shortdescr":"Can for Balkan? Yes we can!","longdescr":"Balkan countries and the people who live there are often stereotyped in comics. The exhibition 'Can for Balkan' is not only about that world of stereotyping, but also about the history of the Balkan and its comics culture. In addition, the exhibition also offers a contemporary artistic view of the region's history through 64 original comics created by 67 artists. Their work was selected as part of an international competition.\r\n\r\nCan For Balkan is a European project under the open call \"Strengthening cultural cooperation with and competitiveness of cultural and creative industries in the Western Balkans\".","performers":"Nicolae Pepene (concept, curation, graphic design, exhibition structure design), Octav Ungureanu (graphic design), Mihai Ungureanu (graphic design), Cosmin Vi\u0219an (graphic design), Gy\u00f6rgy Szigy\u00e1rt\u00f3 (graphic design), Octavian Boldijar (graphic design), Cristi Farca\u0219 (video animations ), Ovidiu Coci\u0219  (video animations ), Octav Ungureanu  (video animations )","boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.546800"},"de":{"name":"Can for Balkan","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.546800"},"it":{"name":"Can for Balkan","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.546800"},"sp":{"name":"Can for Balkan","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.546800"},"pt":{"name":"Can for Balkan","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.546800"},"cn":{"name":"Can for Balkan","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.546800"}},"place":{"id":202864,"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Mus\u00e9e de la Bande Dessin\u00e9e (Centre Belge de la Bande Dessin\u00e9e)","address_street_name":"Rue des Sables","address_street_number":"20","address_street_box":null,"email":"visit@cbbd.be","website":"http:\/\/www.cbbd.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 219 19 80","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue des Sables, 20","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Attraction incontournable situ\u00e9e au c\u0153ur de Bruxelles, le mus\u00e9e de la BD met \u00e0 l'honneur depuis plus de 25 ans auteurs et h\u00e9ros du 9\u00e8me Art. \r\n\r\nLes expositions permanentes r\u00e9guli\u00e8rement renouvel\u00e9es et un vaste programme d'expositions temporaires am\u00e8nent les visiteurs \u00e0 d\u00e9couvrir les innombrables facettes de la bande dessin\u00e9e. Tintin et les Schtroumpfs ouvrent la voie vers d'autres aventures, \u00e0 la rencontre d'un monde dont la cr\u00e9ativit\u00e9 n'a aucune limite. \r\n\r\nMagnifi\u00e9 par un exceptionnel cadre Art Nouveau con\u00e7u par Victor Horta, le Mus\u00e9e de la Bande Dessin\u00e9e est tout autant un hommage aux pionniers qu'un regard sur la BD actuelle.\r\n\r\nOuvert 7 jours sur 7, de 10h \u00e0 18h pendant les vacances scolaires belges.\r\n\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"Stripmuseum (Belgisch Stripcentrum)","address_street_name":"Zandstraat","address_street_number":"20","address_street_box":null,"email":"visit@stripmuseum.be","website":"http:\/\/www.stripmuseum.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 219 19 80","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussel","address_line1":"Zandstraat, 20","address_line2":"1000 Brussel","description_web":"Het Stripmuseum is voor al wie Brussel bezoekt een \u2018must\u2019 in het hartje van de stad. Al meer dan 25 jaar richt het museum de spots op de auteurs en de helden van de Negende Kunst. \r\n\r\nAan de hand van permanente tentoonstellingen \u2013 die regelmatig vernieuwd worden \u2013 en een afwisselend programma van tijdelijke exposities kan je er als bezoeker kennismaken met de talrijke facetten van het stripverhaal. Kuifje en de Smurfen nemen je mee naar avonturenland, een wereld waar de creativiteit geen grenzen kent. \r\n\r\nHet uitzonderlijke art nouveau-gebouw van Victor Horta geeft een bezoek nog een extra dimensie. Het Stripmuseum is tegelijk een hommage aan de pioniers van het medium als een blik op het hedendaagse stripverhaal.\r\n\r\nOpen van maandag tot zondag van 10 uur tot 18 uur tijdens de Belgische schoolvakanties.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"Comic Strip Museum  (Centre Belge de la Bande Dessin\u00e9e)","address_street_name":"Rue des Sables","address_street_number":"20","address_street_box":null,"email":"visit@comicscenter.net","website":"http:\/\/www.comicscenter.net\/en\/home","phone_contact":"+32 2 219 19 80","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussels","address_line1":"Rue des Sables, 20","address_line2":"1000 Brussels","description_web":"An accomplished attraction located in the heart of Brussels, the Belgian Comic Strip Center has been honouring the creators and heroes of the 9th Art for more than 25 years.\r\n\r\nThe regularly renewed permanent exhibitions and a diversified programme of temporary exhibitions enable visitors to discover the countless aspects of comics art. Tintin and the Smurfs lead the way towards further adventures, an encounter with a world where creativity has no limits. \r\n\r\nEnhanced by an exceptional Art Nouveau home designed by Victor Horta, the Belgian Comic Strip Center is just as much a tribute to the pioneers as a glimpse of contemporary comics art.\r\n\r\nOpen every day (7\/7) in July and August and during Belgian school holidays.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"de":{"name":"Comic-Museum (Centre Belge de la Bande Dessin\u00e9e)","address_street_name":"Rue des Sables","address_street_number":"20","address_street_box":null,"email":"visit@cbbd.be","website":"https:\/\/www.comicscenter.net\/en\/other-languages","phone_contact":"+32 2 219 19 80","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue des Sables, 20","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Br\u00fcssel als Comic-Hauptstadt g\u00f6nnt sich den Luxus eines eigenen Comic-Museums - das \u201eCentre Belge de la Bande Dessin\u00e9e\u201c. In einem eindrucksvollen Jugendstil-Bau aus der Feder von Victor Horta wird belgische und internationale Comic-Kunst pr\u00e4sentiert. Willkommen im Reich der Schl\u00fcmpfe, bei Tim und Struppi, Lucky Luke, Spirou, Gaston Lagaffe und all den anderen Comic-Helden!\r\n\r\nComic-Kunst und Jugendstilarchitektur: Der ber\u00fchmte Jugendstilarchitekt Victor Horta entwarf 1903, auf dem H\u00f6hepunkt seines Schaffens, Pl\u00e4ne f\u00fcr ein weitl\u00e4ufiges Bauwerk in Br\u00fcssel. Nach der Renovierung 1989 lie\u00df sich in den R\u00e4umen, die in allen Bereichen durch Jugendstilelemente gepr\u00e4gt sind, das \u201eCentre Belge de la Bande Dessin\u00e9e\", das Belgische Comiczentrum nieder, bei dem sich auf einer Fl\u00e4che von mehr als 4000 m\u00b2 - von den Urspr\u00fcngen bis hin zu avantgardistischen Werken - alles um Comics dreht.\r\n\r\nBelgische Comic-Kunst in all ihren Formen: Ausstellungen, Konferenzen, Kreativ-Workshops, Veranstaltungen, eine eigene Comic-Bibliothek mit Dokumentationszentrum sowie eine gut sortierte Buchhandlung bilden ein vielseitiges und buntes Comicangebot. Zentrale Themen der Dauerausstellung sind die Erfindung der Comic-Kunst, die Formen und die Entwicklung der Comic-Kunst sowie verschiedene Schwerpunkt auf belgische Comic-K\u00fcnstler von Peyo, dem Vater der Schl\u00fcmpfe bis Herg\u00e9, dem Erfinder von Tim & Struppi.\r\n\r\nComic-Fans auf zum Br\u00fcsseler Comic-Mekka!\r\n\r\nGe\u00f6ffnet von Montag bis Sonntag in Juli und August.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"it":{"name":"Museo del Fumetto","address_street_name":"Rue des Sables","address_street_number":"20","address_street_box":null,"email":"visit@comicscenter.net","website":"https:\/\/www.comicscenter.net\/en\/other-languages","phone_contact":"+32 2 219 19 80","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue des Sables, 20","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Il Museo del Fumetto CBBD, situato nel cuore storico di Bruxelles, riunisce su pi\u00f9 di 4.000 m\u00b2 tutto ci\u00f2 che riguarda il fumetto. Ospitato in un edificio tempio dell'Art Nouveau disegnato da Victor Horta, il museo \u00e8 il regno di celebri eroi dei fumetti belgi: Tintin, i Puffi, Lucky Luke, Gaston Lagaffe, Blake et Mortimer, Marsupilami... Le esposizioni organizzate, la biblioteca e il centro di documentazione, non solo rendono il museo vivo e dinamico, ma sono veri e propri centri di documentazione sul fumetto il cuicatalogo \u00e8 accessibile on-line. Il centro belga del fumetto organizza conferenze, laboratori creativi ed animazioni, ecc.\r\n\r\n\r\nAperto i giorni festivi eccetto il 25\/12 e 01\/01. Il Centro Belga del Fumetto diverse formule di visita: la visita guidata del museo, quella del Percorso del Fumetto o quella del museo Marc Sleen. Il museo, anzi il centro belga del fumetto-CBBD ospita anche una brasserie dove potete respirare l'inconfondibile atmosfera di Bruxelles.\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"sp":{"name":"Centro belga del c\u00f3mic (CBBD)","address_street_name":"Rue des Sables","address_street_number":"20","address_street_box":null,"email":"visit@comicscenter.net","website":"https:\/\/www.comicscenter.net\/en\/other-languages","phone_contact":"+32 2 219 19 80","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue des Sables, 20","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Ubicado en el centro de Bruselas, en un edificio Art Nouveau construido por Victor Horta en 1906, el CBBD abri\u00f3 sus puertas el 6 de octubre de 1989. \r\n\r\nEn pocos a\u00f1os, este museo se ha convertido en una de las principales atracciones de Bruselas. \r\n\r\nCada a\u00f1o, m\u00e1s de 200.000 visitantes recorren las exposiciones permanentes y temporales que se celebran en m\u00e1s de 4.000 m 2. \r\n\r\nAunque las exposiciones contribuyen a convertir este templo en un lugar viviente, din\u00e1mico y atrayente, esta herramienta al servicio de la promoci\u00f3n del c\u00f3mic constituye un centro de documentaci\u00f3n moderno, con un cat\u00e1logo accesible online. \r\n\r\nTambi\u00e9n se llevan a cabo conferencias y talleres creativos.\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"pt":{"name":"O Centro Belga da Banda Desenhada","address_street_name":"Rue des Sables","address_street_number":"20","address_street_box":null,"email":"visit@cbbd.be","website":"http:\/\/www.cbbd.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 219 19 80","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue des Sables, 20","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Atra\u00e7\u00e3o incontorn\u00e1vel situada no centro de Bruxelas, o museu da BD comemora mais de 25 anos de autores e her\u00f3is da 9.\u00aa arte.\r\nAs exposi\u00e7\u00f5es permanentes regularmente renovadas e um vasto programa de exposi\u00e7\u00f5es tempor\u00e1rias levam os visitantes a descobrir as in\u00fameras facetas da banda desenhada. Tintim e os Estrumpfes abrem a porta a outras aventuras, ao encontro de um mundo onde a criatividade n\u00e3o tem limites. \r\nAmpliado por uma moldura invulgar Arte Nouveau concebida por Victor Horta, o Museu da Banda Desenhada \u00e9 tanto uma homenagem aos pioneiros que um olhar sobre a BD atual.\r\nAberto todos os dias das 10 \u00e0s 18 horas.\r\nEntrada gratuita apenas com o Brussels Card \u201c100masters\u201d","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"cn":{"name":"The Belgian Comic Strip Center","address_street_name":"Rue des Sables","address_street_number":"20","address_street_box":null,"email":"visit@cbbd.be","website":"http:\/\/www.cbbd.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 219 19 80","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue des Sables, 20","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null}},"districts":[],"zones":{"list":[19],"translations":{"fr":["Centre"],"nl":["Centrum"],"en":["Centre"],"de":["Zentrum"],"it":[null],"sp":[null],"pt":[null],"cn":[null]}},"neca":null,"facebook_id":null,"backoffice_id":405,"location":{"lat":50.85107181,"lon":4.36006874},"region":"brussels","last_updated_at":"2023-01-02T01:35:35+01:00","published_at":"2013-10-19T01:13:30+02:00","import_origin":null,"external_id":null,"is_in_address_book":true,"is_in_vb_export":true,"resto_ranking":0},"organizer":{"id":202864,"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Mus\u00e9e de la Bande Dessin\u00e9e (Centre Belge de la Bande Dessin\u00e9e)","address_street_name":"Rue des Sables","address_street_number":"20","address_street_box":null,"email":"visit@cbbd.be","website":"http:\/\/www.cbbd.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 219 19 80","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue des Sables, 20","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Attraction incontournable situ\u00e9e au c\u0153ur de Bruxelles, le mus\u00e9e de la BD met \u00e0 l'honneur depuis plus de 25 ans auteurs et h\u00e9ros du 9\u00e8me Art. \r\n\r\nLes expositions permanentes r\u00e9guli\u00e8rement renouvel\u00e9es et un vaste programme d'expositions temporaires am\u00e8nent les visiteurs \u00e0 d\u00e9couvrir les innombrables facettes de la bande dessin\u00e9e. Tintin et les Schtroumpfs ouvrent la voie vers d'autres aventures, \u00e0 la rencontre d'un monde dont la cr\u00e9ativit\u00e9 n'a aucune limite. \r\n\r\nMagnifi\u00e9 par un exceptionnel cadre Art Nouveau con\u00e7u par Victor Horta, le Mus\u00e9e de la Bande Dessin\u00e9e est tout autant un hommage aux pionniers qu'un regard sur la BD actuelle.\r\n\r\nOuvert 7 jours sur 7, de 10h \u00e0 18h pendant les vacances scolaires belges.\r\n\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"Stripmuseum (Belgisch Stripcentrum)","address_street_name":"Zandstraat","address_street_number":"20","address_street_box":null,"email":"visit@stripmuseum.be","website":"http:\/\/www.stripmuseum.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 219 19 80","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussel","address_line1":"Zandstraat, 20","address_line2":"1000 Brussel","description_web":"Het Stripmuseum is voor al wie Brussel bezoekt een \u2018must\u2019 in het hartje van de stad. Al meer dan 25 jaar richt het museum de spots op de auteurs en de helden van de Negende Kunst. \r\n\r\nAan de hand van permanente tentoonstellingen \u2013 die regelmatig vernieuwd worden \u2013 en een afwisselend programma van tijdelijke exposities kan je er als bezoeker kennismaken met de talrijke facetten van het stripverhaal. Kuifje en de Smurfen nemen je mee naar avonturenland, een wereld waar de creativiteit geen grenzen kent. \r\n\r\nHet uitzonderlijke art nouveau-gebouw van Victor Horta geeft een bezoek nog een extra dimensie. Het Stripmuseum is tegelijk een hommage aan de pioniers van het medium als een blik op het hedendaagse stripverhaal.\r\n\r\nOpen van maandag tot zondag van 10 uur tot 18 uur tijdens de Belgische schoolvakanties.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"Comic Strip Museum  (Centre Belge de la Bande Dessin\u00e9e)","address_street_name":"Rue des Sables","address_street_number":"20","address_street_box":null,"email":"visit@comicscenter.net","website":"http:\/\/www.comicscenter.net\/en\/home","phone_contact":"+32 2 219 19 80","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussels","address_line1":"Rue des Sables, 20","address_line2":"1000 Brussels","description_web":"An accomplished attraction located in the heart of Brussels, the Belgian Comic Strip Center has been honouring the creators and heroes of the 9th Art for more than 25 years.\r\n\r\nThe regularly renewed permanent exhibitions and a diversified programme of temporary exhibitions enable visitors to discover the countless aspects of comics art. Tintin and the Smurfs lead the way towards further adventures, an encounter with a world where creativity has no limits. \r\n\r\nEnhanced by an exceptional 