ibilit\u00e9 publique. Le programme soutient la recherche innovante sous diverses formes : expositions, installations, podcasts, conf\u00e9rences, essais, performances, etc.\r\n\r\nL'exposition After \/ D\u2019apr\u00e8s \/ Na de Meessen int\u00e8gre l'architecture dans un environnement partag\u00e9 entre ses diff\u00e9rents cohabitants, humains et non-humains. L'exposition tisse un lien entre deux types d'architecture qui caract\u00e9risent La Garenne, une parcelle rurale situ\u00e9e dans la banlieue de Bruxelles : le cottage d'inspiration Art nouveau, illustr\u00e9 par une \u0153uvre d\u00e9molie de L\u00e9on Sneyers (dont divers documents sont conserv\u00e9s dans les Collections du CIVA), et la maison contemporaine, telle qu'articul\u00e9e par OFFICE Kersten Geers David Van Severen et leur projet sur le m\u00eame site.","performers":"Fran\u00e7is Carpentier, Silvia Franceschini","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.civa.brussels","email":"info@civa.brussels","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 2 642 24 50","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.544643"},"nl":{"name":"Research in residence  #1 Vincent Meessen","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":"info@civa.brussels","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.544643"},"en":{"name":"Research in residence  #1 Vincent Meessen","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":"info@civa.brussels","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.544643"},"de":{"name":"Research in residence  #1 Vincent Meessen","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail