. In that room he would produce more or less half the amount of his paintings and gouaches. \r\nThe headquarters of the Belgian Surrealists was also in the Esseghemstraat 135, where they held their meetings on Saturday evenings and where they organized several tableaux vivants.\r\n\r\nSince November 2019, a new museum of abstract art has opened next door. Both museums are connected with each other www.abstractartmuseum.be \r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":"https:\/\/ticket.visit.brussels\/en\/233245\/musee-rene-magritte-maison\/shop","sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"de":{"name":"Ren\u00e9 Magritte Museum \u2013 Museum f\u00fcr abstrakte Kunst","address_street_name":"Rue Esseghem","address_street_number":"135","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@magrittemuseum.be","website":"http:\/\/www.magrittemuseum.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 428 26 26","phone_booking":"+32 2 428 26 26","address_zip":"1090","address_city":"Jette","address_line1":"Rue Esseghem, 135","address_line2":"1090 Jette","description_web":"Das Ren\u00e9 Magritte Museum ist in doppeltes Museum, das sich sowohl dem Surrealismus als auch der abstrakten Kunst aus Belgien widmet. Mit dieser Initiative soll daran erinnert werden, dass Magritte - bevor er sich 1926 dem Surrealismus zuwandte - auch ein Pionier auf dem Gebiet der abstrakten Kunst war. Das Museum erstreckt sich \u00fcber zwei H\u00e4user. ","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"it":{"name":"Maison-Mus\u00e9e Ren\u00e9 Magritte","address_street_name":"Rue Esseghem","address_street_number":"135","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@magrittemuseum.be","website":"http:\/\/www.magrittemuseum.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 428 26 26","phone_booking":"+32 2 428 26 26","address_zip":"1090","address_city":"Jette","address_line1":"Rue Esseghem, 135","address_line2":"1090 Jette","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"sp":{"name":"La C