lles, en face de l\u2019H\u00f4tel de ville. Vous reconna\u00eetrez nos guides gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 leur parapluie blanc muni du logo Bravo Discovery.\r\n\r\nDur\u00e9e :\r\nEnviron 3h.\r\n\r\nLangue :\r\nFran\u00e7ais.\r\n\r\nInclus :\r\nGuide francophone passionn\u00e9 et professionnel.\r\n\r\nNon inclus : Entr\u00e9e aux mus\u00e9es\r\nBrussels Comic Book Route","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.bravodiscovery.com","email":"info@bravodiscovery.com","phone_contact":"+32 470 60 35 05","phone_booking":"+32 495 32 03 62","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.539551"},"nl":{"name":"Parcours BD de Bruxelles","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.539551"},"en":{"name":"Brussels Comic Book Route","shortdescr":"Not only is Brussels the capital of Belgium and Europe, it is also the capital of Comic strip. Comic strip images are scattered around the streets telling the adventures of iconic characters such as Tintin, Lucky Luke, the Smurfs or Quick & Flupke.","longdescr":"Program:\r\n\r\nHerg\u00e9 \u2013 Tintin in America.\r\nOlivier Rameau.\r\nLe Passage de Fran\u00e7ois Schuiten.\r\nBroussaille de Frank P\u00e9.\r\nVictor Sackeville.\r\nRic Hochet.\r\nN\u00e9ron.\r\nL\u2019Ange.\r\nLucky Luke.\r\nAst\u00e9rix.\r\nLes r\u00eaves de Nic.\r\nCori le Moussaillon.\r\nGaston Lagaffe.\r\nPoje.\r\nSmurf statue.\r\n\r\nPractical information:\r\n\r\nPrice:\r\nAdults: 35\u20ac\r\nChildren (6 to 12 years old): 20\u20ac\r\nChildren (under 6 years old): Free.\r\n\r\nWhen:\r\nEvery Sunday.\r\nStarting time:\r\n10:30am\r\n\r\nMeeting point:\r\nGrand-Place in front of the City Hall. Find our guides! They hold a white umbrella.\r\n\r\nDuration:\r\nAbout 3 hours.\r\n\r\nLanguage:\r\nEnglish.\r\n\r\nIncluded:\r\nProfessional guides (English-speaking). Experts and passionate about the history of the Comic Book Art.\r\n\r\nNot included:\r\nThe tram or bus tickets.\r\nThe tickets to the museums","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.bravodiscovery.com","email":"info@bravodiscovery.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.539551"},"de":{"name":"Parcours BD de Bruxelles","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.539551"},"it":{"name":"Parcours BD de Bruxelles","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.539551"},"sp":{"name":"Parcours BD de Bruxelles","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.539551"},"pt":{"name":"Parcours BD de Bruxelles","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.539551"},"cn":{"name":"Parcours BD de Bruxelles","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.539551"}},"place":{"id":258936,"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Bravo Discovery sprl","address_street_name":"Rue du Midi 76","address_street_number":"76","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@bravodiscovery.com","website":"http:\/\/www.bravodiscovery.com","phone_contact":"+32 470 60 35 05","phone_booking":"+32 495 32 03 62","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue du Midi 76, 76","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Bravo Discovery vous offre un service de qualit\u00e9 sur toute la Belgique, avec l'\u00e9thique d'un tourisme responsable.\r\nNous travaillons en partenariat avec l'Office du Tourisme bruxellois (visit.brussels). Nos collaborateurs sont des guides professionnels et nous avons une \u00e9quipe de guides free-lance dont la plupart ont \u00e9t\u00e9 form\u00e9s dans les Hautes \u00c9coles bruxelloises.\r\n\u200bNotre sp\u00e9cialisation : nous sommes sp\u00e9cialis\u00e9s dans les visites guid\u00e9es faites sur mesure, adapt\u00e9es aux attentes de nos clients. Nous sommes \u00e9galement attentifs \u00e0 l'\u00e9quilibre entre culture et d\u00e9lassement.\r\n\u200bNotre force : exp\u00e9rience, guides locaux, collaborateurs passionn\u00e9s.\r\nNos valeurs : professionnalisme, passion du patrimoine, tourisme responsable.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"Bravo Discovery sprl","address_street_name":"ZuitStaat","address_street_number":"76","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@bravodiscovery.com","website":"http:\/\/www.bravodiscovery.com","phone_contact":"+32 470 60 35 05","phone_booking":"+32 495 32 03 62","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussel","address_line1":"ZuitStaat, 76","address_line2":"1000 Brussel","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"Bravo Discovery sprl","address_street_name":"Rue du Midi 76","address_street_number":"76","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@bravodiscovery.com","website":"http:\/\/www.bravodiscovery.com","phone_contact":"+32 470 60 35 05","phone_booking":"+32 495 32 03 62","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussels","address_line1":"Rue du Midi 76, 76","address_line2":"1000 Brussels","description_web":"Bravo Discovery offers you a quality tour guide service anywhere in Belgium.\r\nWe work in conjunction with the Brussels tourism office. We practice responsible tourism while respecting the local economy. Our employees are professional guides and we have a team of freelance guides trained in the \u201cHaute \u00c9coles\u201d of Brussels.\r\n\u200bWe work in partnership with local businesses and can call on a range of quality service providers to suit your needs.\r\nWe specialize in providing tailor-made tours, based on the interests of our clients and mindful of the need to balance culture and relaxation.\r\n\u200bOur strengths: experience, local guides, enthusiastic and charismatic staff.\r\nOur values: responsible tourism, professionalism, respect of the historical and cultural heritage, protection of the environment, sustainable competitiveness.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"de":{"name":"Bravo Discovery sprl","address_street_name":"Rue du Midi 76","address_street_number":"76","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@bravodiscovery.com","website":"http:\/\/www.bravodiscovery.com","phone_contact":"+32 470 60 35 05","phone_booking":"+32 495 32 03 62","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue du Midi 76, 76","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"it":{"name":"Bravo Discovery sprl","address_street_name":"Rue du Midi 76","address_street_number":"76","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@bravodiscovery.com","website":"http:\/\/www.bravodiscovery.com","phone_contact":"+32 470 60 35 05","phone_booking":"+32 495 32 03 62","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue du Midi 76, 76","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"sp":{"name":"Bravo Discovery sprl","address_street_name":"Rue du M