u00e8l\u00e8 martiniquais, sa musique, g\u00e9n\u00e9reuse, se m\u00e9lange \u00e0 des genres plus contemporains. Il sera accompagn\u00e9 \u00e0 Bruxelles de J\u00e9r\u00e9my Bruy\u00e8re \u00e0 la contrebasse et de Kristof N\u00e9grit \u00e0 la batterie","performers":"Herv\u00e9 Celcal : piano\r\n\u00e9r\u00e9my Bruy\u00e8re : contrebasse \r\nKristof N\u00e9grit : batterie","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.lebaixu.be","email":"info@lebaixu.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.547841"},"nl":{"name":"\u00ab Jazz Cr\u00e9ole \u00bb -  Herve Celcal Trio","shortdescr":"Herv\u00e9 Celcal is pianist, componist, arrangeur en producer. Sinds 2013 leidt hij een carri\u00e8re als jazzman met twee albums: \"Bel air for piano\" en \"Colombo\", die hem tot een van de belangrijkste pianisten van de Creoolse jazz van vandaag maken.","longdescr":"Geworteld in de traditie van de b\u00e8l\u00e8 van Martinique, is zijn muziek genereus en vermengt hij zich met meer hedendaagse genres. Hij wordt in Brussel begeleid door J\u00e9r\u00e9my Bruy\u00e8re op contrabas en Kristof N\u00e9grit op drums.","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.547841"},"en":{"name":"\u00ab Jazz Cr\u00e9ole \u00bb -  Herve Celcal Trio","shortdescr":"ENG\r\nHerv\u00e9 Celcal is a pianist, composer, arranger and producer. Since 2013, he has led a career as a jazzman with two albums: \"Bel air for piano\" and \"Colombo\", which make him one of the major pianists of Creole jazz today.","longdescr":"Anchored in the tradition of Martinique's b\u00e8l\u00e8, his generous music combines with more contemporary genres. He will be playing in Brussels with J\u00e9r\u00e9my Bruy\u00e8re on double bass and Kristof N\u00e9grit on drums.","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,