rmeront en une descente abyssale dans on ne sait pas quoi et c\u2019est pourquoi on dit une descente aux enfers, car dans la case enfer on peut tout mettre.\r\n\r\n\u00c0 travers l\u2019anecdote du v\u00eatement, NORMAN c\u2019est comme normal, \u00e0 une lettre pr\u00e8s questionne joyeusement le rapport \u00e0 la norme, l\u2019acceptation de la diff\u00e9rence et les codes culturels d\u2019appartenance aux genres. Jamais didactique, encore moins moralisateur, le spectacle privil\u00e9gie l\u2019humour, la danse, les jeux de mots et de narration. \r\n\r\n\u00c0 partir de 8 ans.","performers":"Direction et chor\u00e9graphie: Cl\u00e9ment Thirion | Interpr\u00e9tation: Antoine Cogniaux, Deborah Marchal, Lylybeth Merle| Ecriture et dramaturgie: Marie Henry","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.pierredelune.be","email":"ticket@charleroi-danse.be","phone_contact":"+32 71 20 56 40","phone_booking":"+32 2 218 79 35","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.542662"},"nl":{"name":"Norman, c\u2019est comme normal \u00e0 une lettre pr\u00e8s","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.charleroi-danse.be","email":"contact@pierredelune.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 218 79 35","phone_booking":"+32 71 20 56 40","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.542662"},"en":{"name":"Norman, c\u2019est comme normal \u00e0 une lettre pr\u00e8s","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.542662"},"de":{"name":"Norman, c\u2019est comme normal \u00e0 une lettre pr\u00e8s","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.542662"},"it":{"name":"Norman, c\u2019est comme normal \u00e0 une lettre pr\u00e8s","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.542662"},"sp":{"name":"Norman, c\u2019est comme normal \u00e0 une lettre pr\u00e8s","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.542662"},"pt":{"name":"Norman, c\u2019est comme normal \u00e0 une lettre pr\u00e8s","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.542662"},"cn":{"name":"Norman, c\u2019est comme normal \u00e0 une lettre pr\u00e8s","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.542662"}},"place":{"id":144,"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Charleroi danse \/ La Raffinerie","address_street_name":"Rue de Manchester","address_street_number":"21","address_street_box":null,"email":"contact@charleroi-danse.be","website":"http:\/\/www.charleroi-danse.be","phone_contact":"+32 71 20 56 40","phone_booking":"+32 71 20 56 40","address_zip":"1080","address_city":"Molenbeek-Saint-Jean","address_line1":"Rue de Manchester, 21","address_line2":"1080 Molenbeek-Saint-Jean","description_web":"Construite au milieu du XIXe si\u00e8cle, l'ancienne raffinerie de sucre Gr\u00e4ffe demeure, avec ses murs de brique et son ossature de fer et de fonte, un t\u00e9moin important de l'architecture industrielle du quartier de la place de la Duchesse de Brabant. \r\nEn 1979, l'ensemble des b\u00e2timents fut reconverti en un lieu \u00e0 vocation culturelle, si\u00e8ge du renomm\u00e9 Plan K qui y pr\u00e9sentera des nombreux spectacles de th\u00e9\u00e2tre et de danse, des concerts, des films, des expositions.\r\nR\u00e9nov\u00e9e, La Raffinerie abrite actuellement l'antenne bruxelloise de Charleroi danse, Centre chor\u00e9graphique de la F\u00e9d\u00e9ration Wallonie-Bruxelles.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"Charleroi danse \/ La Raffinerie","address_street_name":"Manchesterstraat","address_street_number":"21","address_street_box":null,"email":"contact@charleroi-danse.be","website":"http:\/\/www.charleroi-danse.be","phone_contact":"+32 71 20 56 40","phone_booking":"+32 71 20 56 40","address_zip":"1080","address_city":"Sint-Jans-Molenbeek","address_line1":"Manchesterstraat, 21","address_line2":"1080 Sint-Jans-Molenbeek","description_web":"Built in the mid-nineteenth century, the old Gr\u00e4ffe sugar refinery, with its brick walls and frame and cast iron, an important witness of the industrial architecture of the neighborhood instead of the Duchess of Brabant. \r\nIn 1979, all the buildings were converted into a place for cultural, seat of famous Plan K, which presented many theater and dance performances, concerts, films and exhibitions. \r\nRenovated, The Refinery currently houses the Brussels branch of Charleroi danse, Choreographic Centre of the Federation Wallonia-Brussels. \r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"Charleroi danse \/ La Raffinerie","address_street_name":"Manchesterstreet","address_street_number":"21","address_street_box":null,"email":"contact@charleroi-danse.be","website":"http:\/\/www.charleroi-danse.be","phone_contact":"+32 71 20 56 40","phone_booking":"+32 71 20 56 40","address_zip":"1080","address_city":"Molenbeek-Saint-Jean","address_line1":"Manchesterstreet, 21","address_line2":"1080 Molenbeek-Saint-Jean","description_web":"Gebouwd in het midden van de 19de eeuw, vormt de voormalige suikerraffinaderij Gr\u00e4ffe, met zijn bakstenen muren en geraamte uit ijzer en gietijzer, en belangrijke getuige van het industri\u00ebel verlenden van de Hertogin van Brabantwijk.\r\nIn 1979, kreeg het geheel van gebouwen een culturele bestemming. Het Plan K organiseerde er talloze theater en dansvoorstellingen, concerten, films, tentoonstelligen.\r\nIn La Raffineriej, die ondertussen werd gerenoveerd, is thans de Brusselse afdeling van Charleroi danse, Choreografisch Centrum van de Federatie Walloni\u00eb-Brussel ondergebracht.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"de":{"name":"Charleroi danse \/ La Raffinerie","address_street_name":"Rue de Manchester","address_street_number":"21","address_street_box":null,"email":"contact@charleroi-danse.be","website":"http:\/\/www.charleroi-danse.be","phone_contact":"+32 71 20 56 40","phone_booking":"+32 71 20 56 40","address_zip":"1080","address_city":"Molenbeek-Saint-Jean","address_line1":"Rue de Manchester, 21","address_line2":"1080 Molenbeek-Saint-Jean","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"it":{"name":"Charleroi danse \/ La Raffinerie","address_street_name":"Rue de Manchester","address_street_number":"21","address_street_box":null,"email":"contact@charleroi-danse.be","website":"http:\/\/www.charleroi-danse.be","phone_contact":"+32 71 20 56 40","phone_booking":"+32 71 20 56 40","address_zip":"1080","address_city":"Molenbeek-Saint-Jean","address_line1":"Rue de Manchester, 21","address_line2":"1080 Molenbeek-Saint-Jean","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"sp":{"name":"Charleroi danse \/ La Raffinerie","address_street_name":"Rue de Manchester","address_street_number":"21","address_street_box":null,"email":"contact@charleroi-danse.be","website":"http:\/\/www.charleroi-dans