00e9nagements pour personnes sourdes et malentendantes","Chien d'assistance","Parking accessible","Accessible aux pi\u00e9tons appareill\u00e9s","WC adapt\u00e9"],"nl":["Toegankelijk voor mensen met een verstandelijke beperking","Voorzieningen voor blinde en slechtziende personen","Voorzieningen voor dove en slechthorende personen","Assistentiehonden","Toegankelijke parking","Toegankelijk voor voetgangers met hulpmiddelen","Aangepast toilet"],"en":["Accessible to people with intellectual disabilities","Facilities for blind and partially-sighted persons","Facilities for deaf and hearing-impaired people","Assistance dogs","Accessible parking","Accessible to pedestrians with mobility aids","Adapted toilet"],"de":["Barrierefrei f\u00fcr Menschen mit Verst\u00e4ndnisschwierigkeiten","Anpassungen f\u00fcr blinde und sehbehinderte Menschen","Anpassungen f\u00fcr geh\u00f6rlose und h\u00f6rgesch\u00e4digte Menschen.","Assistenzhund","Barrierefreier Parkplatz","Barrierefrei f\u00fcr Fu\u00dfg\u00e4nger mit Gehhilfe","Barrierefreies WC"],"it":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null],"sp":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null],"pt":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null],"cn":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null]}},"facebook_link":null,"publication_state":"public","last_updated_at":"2022-11-23T15:51:01+01:00","published_at":"2022-08-25T13:42:08+02:00","backoffice_id":260375,"import_origin":null,"sub_type":"theatre","show_in_agenda":true,"ranking":1},{"id":548197,"date_start":"2023-01-27","date_end":"2023-01-29","date_next":"2023-01-27","accept_article27":true,"accept_cultuurbon":false,"accept_paspartoe":false,"is_closed_on_public_holidays":false,"is_closed_on_school_holidays":false,"is_only_by_appointment":false,"is_permanent":false,"is_free":false,"is_online":false,"is_canceled":false,"is_soldout":false,"categories":{"main":{"id":49,"translations":{"fr":"Th\u00e9\u00e2tre","nl":"Theater","en":"Theatre","de":"Theater","it":null,"sp":null,"pt":null,"cn":null}},"others":{"list":[50],"translations":{"fr":["Th\u00e9\u00e2tre"],"nl":["Theater"],"en":["Theatre"],"de":["Theater"],"it":[null],"sp":[null],"pt":[null],"cn":[null]}}},"languages":{"spoken":["fr"],"subtitles":[]},"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Off\/On","shortdescr":"Une pi\u00e8ce qui interroge sur comment se (re)connecter \u00e0 ses \u00e9motions dans une soci\u00e9t\u00e9 qui vit \u00e0 100 \u00e0 l'heure apr\u00e8s un deuil. Quelle place pour les \u00e9motions? Pour soi? Pour la reconstruction?","longdescr":"Lorsqu\u2019on lui annonce le d\u00e9c\u00e8s de sa m\u00e8re, une partie d\u2019Anas s\u2019\u00e9teint. Comment est-ce que submerg\u00e9 par les \u00e9motions, il finit par n\u2019en exprimer plus aucune ? C\u2019est bien plus tard, qu\u2019Anas ressent le besoin de se reconnecter \u00e0 lui-m\u00eame, de voir le pr\u00e9sent \u00e0 travers l\u2019absent. Il nous livre aujourd\u2019hui un r\u00e9cit de vie touchant et authentique.\r\n\r\n\r\nDans OFF\/ON, seul mais pas vraiment, Anas nous questionne sur comment le deuil influence notre rapport aux autres et nos relations\r\n\r\nSpectacle en fran\u00e7ais","performers":"Interpr\u00e9tation: Anas Achaara\r\nMise en sc\u00e8ne: Mohamed Salim Haouach\r\nTexte: Anas Achaara, Mohamed Salim Haouach, Mehdi Boukoue, Yasmina Ahkim\r\nSc\u00e9nographie: Zenel Laci\r\nR\u00e9gie: Hafsa Aqqal, Adnane El Haruati","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/ras-el-hanout.be\/spectacle\/off-on\/","email":"info@ras-el-hanout.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":"+32 487 01 42 61","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.548197"},"nl":{"name":"Off\/On","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":"Wanneer Anas Achaara op jonge leeftijd zijn mama verliest, dooft een deel van hem uit. Zoveel emotie op een jong leven leidt ertoe dat hij moeite ontwikkelt met het uitdrukken van emoties. Nu vele jaren later neemt Anas ons mee in een hoogstpersoonlijk, authentiek verhaal over verlies en het moeilijke proces van rouw. Mehdi Boukouye, Yasmina Ahkim en Salim Haouach staan hem bij in het creatieproces.\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nAnas is al enkele jaren actief bij de Molenbeekse theatergroep Ras El Hanout. Voor dit moedige stuk \u201cOFF\/ON\u201d neemt hij zelf de pen in handen en zet hij zijn eerste stappen als theatermaker.\r\n\r\nVoorstelling in het Frans","performers":"Voorstelling: Anas Achaara\r\nRegisseur: Mohamed Salim Haouach\r\nTekst: Anas Achaara, Mohamed Salim Haouach, Mehdi Boukoue, Yasmina Ahkim\r\nDecorontwerp: Zenel Laci\r\nRegie: Hafsa Aqqal, Adnane El Haruati","boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.548197"},"en":{"name":"Off\/On","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.548197"},"de":{"name":"Off\/On","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.548197"},"it":{"name":"Off\/On","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.548197"},"sp":{"name":"Off\/On","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.548197"},"pt":{"name":"Off\/On","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.548197"},"cn":{"name":"Off\/On","shortdescr