9es","nl":"Begeleide rondleidingen","en":"Guided tours","de":"Stadtf\u00fchrungen","it":null,"sp":null,"pt":null,"cn":null}},"others":{"list":[249],"translations":{"fr":["Les incontournables "],"nl":["Highlights"],"en":["Highlights"],"de":["Highlights"],"it":[null],"sp":[null],"pt":[null],"cn":[null]}}},"languages":{"spoken":["fr","nl","en"],"subtitles":[]},"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Visite guid\u00e9e de l'exposition 175 ans des Galeries Royales Saint-Hubert","shortdescr":"A l\u2019occasion des 175 ans depuis leur cr\u00e9ation, nos guides se feront un plaisir de vous d\u00e9voiler l\u2019exposition qui a lieu au Cin\u00e9ma Galeries,  pour vous raconter l\u2019histoire des lieux et les vies des personnages extraordinaires qui les ont c\u00f4toy\u00e9.","longdescr":"Construites en 1847 par l\u2019architecte Jean-Pierre Cluysenaar et vrai c\u0153ur battant de la capitale, les Galeries Royales Saint-Hubert ont \u00e9t\u00e9 le th\u00e9\u00e2tre de nombreux \u00e9v\u00e9nements. Lieu de passage oblig\u00e9 pour tout amateur de boutiques de qualit\u00e9 et de gourmandise, c'est \u00e9galement le rendez-vous des amateurs \u00e9clair\u00e9s de livres, de films et de th\u00e9\u00e2tre. A l\u2019occasion des 175 ans depuis leur cr\u00e9ation, nos guides se feront un plaisir de vous d\u00e9voiler l\u2019exposition qui a lieu au Cin\u00e9ma Galeries,  pour vous raconter l\u2019histoire des lieux et les vies des personnages extraordinaires qui les ont c\u00f4toy\u00e9.\r\n\r\nEntr\u00e9e \u00e0 l'exposition gratuite, prix pour le guide:\r\nEn journ\u00e9e: 85\u20ac\/guide \r\nEn nocturne (visite apr\u00e8s 18h00): 110\u20ac\/guide\u00f9\r\nMax 15 personnes par guide\r\n\r\nVisite exclusive, guide costum\u00e9, teambuilding culturel... sur demande","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.itineraires.be","email":"info@itineraires.be","phone_contact":"+32 496 38 85 94","phone_booking":"+32 496 38 85 94","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.547984"},"nl":{"name":"Visite guid\u00e9e de l'exposition 175 ans des Galeries Royales Saint-Hubert","shortdescr":"Ter gelegenheid van de 175e verjaardag van hun oprichting zullen onze gidsen met veel plezier de tentoonstelling in de Cin\u00e9ma Galeries onthullen, om u te vertellen over de geschiedenis van de plek en het leven van de buitengewone mensen die er hebben gewoond.","longdescr":"De Galeries Royales Saint-Hubert, gebouwd in 1847 door de architect Jean-Pierre Cluysenaar, is het kloppende hart van de hoofdstad en is het toneel geweest van vele evenementen. Een must voor iedereen die van kwaliteitswinkels en gastronomisch eten houdt, maar ook een ontmoetingsplaats voor verlichte boeken-, film- en theaterliefhebbers. Ter gelegenheid van de 175e verjaardag van hun oprichting zullen onze gidsen met veel plezier de tentoonstelling in de Cin\u00e9ma Galeries onthullen, om u te vertellen over de geschiedenis van de plek en het leven van de buitengewone mensen die er hebben gewoond.\r\n\r\nGratis toegang tot de tentoonstelling, prijs voor de gids:\r\nOverdag: 85\u20ac\/gids \r\nBij nacht (bezoek na 18u): 110\u20ac\/gids\r\n\r\nMax 15 deelnemers per gids\r\n\r\nExclusief bezoek, gekostumeerde gids, culturele teambuilding... op aanvraag","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":"info@itineraires.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.547984"},"en":{"name":"Visite guid\u00e9e de l'exposition 175 ans des Galeries Royales Saint-Hubert","shortdescr":". On the occasion of the 175th anniversary of their creation, our guides will be happy to unveil the exhibition that is taking place at the Cin\u00e9ma Galeries, to tell you the history of the place and the lives of the extraordinary people who have lived there.","longdescr":"Built in 1847 by the architect Jean-Pierre Cluysenaar, the Galeries Royales Saint-Hubert is the beating heart of the capital and has been the scene of many events. A must-see place for all lovers of quality stores and gourmet food, it is also a meeting place for enlightened book, film and theater lovers. On the occasion of the 175th anniversary of their creation, our guides will be happy to unveil the exhibition that is taking place at the Cin\u00e9ma Galeries, to tell you the history of the place and the lives of the extraordinary people who have lived there.\r\n\r\nFree entrance to the exhibition, price for the guide:\r\nDaytime: 85\u20ac\/guide \r\nBy night (visit after 6pm): 110\u20ac\/guide\r\n\r\nMax 15 people per guide\r\n\r\nExclusive tour, costumed guide, cultural teambuilding... on request","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":"info@itineraires.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.547984"},"de":{"name":"Visite guid\u00e9e de l'exposition 175 ans des Galeries Royales Saint-Hubert","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.547984"},"it":{"name":"Visite guid\u00e9e de l'exposition 175 ans des Galeries Royales Saint-Hubert","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.547984"},"sp":{"name":"Visite guid\u00e9e de l'exposition 175 ans des Galeries Royales Saint-Hubert","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.547984"},"pt":{"name":"Visite guid\u00e9e de l'exposition 175 ans des Galeries Royales Saint-Hubert","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.547984"},"cn":{"name":"Visite guid\u00e9e de l'exposition 175 ans des Galeries Royales Saint-Hubert","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.547984"}},"place":{"id":250994,"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Cin\u00e9ma Galeries","address_street_name":"Galerie de la Reine","address_street_number":"26","address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.galeries.be\/","phone_contact":"+32 2 514 74 98","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Galerie de la Reine, 26","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Le lieu est compos\u00e9 de deux salles de cin\u00e9ma, d\u2019une grande salle d\u2019exposition de 1000 m2, et d\u2019un bar.\r\nConstruit en 1939 par l\u2019architecte Paul Bonduelle, le cin\u00e9ma est class\u00e9 comme monument depuis 1993 en raison de sa valeur historique et artistique; le style du cin\u00e9ma se situe entre l\u2019Art d\u00e9co et le Modernisme et se distingue par une d\u00e9coration subtilement m\u00e9diterran\u00e9enne et romane. Depuis, le CINEMA GALERIES a pris des initiatives afin de d\u00e9velopper et d\u2019am\u00e9liorer la qualit\u00e9 de ce lieu exceptionnel. La r\u00e9novation du cin\u00e9ma initi\u00e9e il y a trois ans est maintenant termin\u00e9e. Dans les salles, le changement du syst\u00e8me son offre une meilleure exp\u00e9rience acoustique.\r\n\r\nLieu consacr\u00e9 aux films d'auteurs, Cinema Galeries propose \u00e9galement un large programme d'expositions d\u00e9di\u00e9 au cin\u00e9ma ind\u00e9pendant et \u00e0 l'art contemporain. De nombreux artistes contemporains comme Eric Baudelaire, Amos Gitai, David Lynch, ... ont \u00e9t\u00e9 invit\u00e9s \u00e0 pr\u00e9senter leur travail, toujours en relation avec le cin\u00e9ma. L'une des missions les plus importantes de CINEMA GALERIES est de soutenir le jeune film belge. Dans le cadre de son partenariat avec KissKissBankBank, le cin\u00e9ma permet \u00e0 son public de d\u00e9couvrir de nouveaux projets.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"Cinema Galeries","address_street_name":"Koninginnegalerij","address_street_number":"26","address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.galeries.be\/","phone_contact":"+32 2 514 74 98","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussel","address_line1":"Koninginnegalerij, 26","address_line2":"1000 Brussel","description_web":"CINEMA GALERIES is een plaats gewijd aan \u2018cinema in al zijn vormen\u2019 in de Koninklijke Sint-Hubertusgalerijen en bestaat uit twee cinemazalen, een expositieruimte van 1000m2 en een nieuwe bar. \r\nCINEMA GALERIES is een unieke plek in het historisch centrum, gebouwd in 1939 door de architect Paul Bonduelle en geklasseerd als monument sinds 1993 wegens zijn historische en artistieke waarde. De stijl van de cinema bevindt zich tussen Art Deco en Modernisme en onderscheidt zich door een unieke decoratie. De unieke zaal met 600 plaatsen is in 1973 omgevormd door de architect Danlee waardoor er ook een tweede zaal op de eerste verdieping werd toegevoegd. \r\nSindsdien heeft CINEMA GALERIES initiatieven genomen om de kwaliteit van deze uitzonderlijke plaats te verbeteren. \r\nDe renovatie van de bioscoop werd drie jaar geleden ingeleid en is nu voltooid. In de filmzalen is het geluidssysteem veranderd met een betere geluidservaring als gevolg. \r\n\r\nCinema Galeries biedt een breed programma aan festivals en tentoonstellingen gewijd aan de onafhankelijke film en hedendaagse kunst. Veel hedendaagse artiesten als Eric Baudelaire, Amos Gitai, David Lynch, ... werden uitgenodigd om hun werk te presenteren, altijd in relatie tot film. Ook het ondersteunen van de jonge Belgische film is een belangrijke missie van CINEMA GALERIES. In het kader van het partnerschap met KissKissBankBank geeft de bioscoop zijn publiek  de kans om nieuwe projecten te ontdekken.\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"Cinema Galeries","address_street_name":"Galerie de la Reine","address_street_number":"26","address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.galeries.be\/","phone_contact":"+32 2 514 74 98","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussels","address_line1":"Galerie de la Reine, 26","address_line2":"1000 Brussels","description_web":"An emblematic venue for creative movies and festivals, CINEMA GALERIES also offers a wide programme of exhibitions dedicated to independent cinema and contemporary art. Many contemporary artists like Eric Baudelaire, Amos Gitai, David Lynch, etc. have been invited to present work related to cinema. Another important mission of CINEMA GALERIES is to support young Belgian film-making. The cinema's audience gets the chance to discover new projects thanks to its partnership with KissKissBankBank.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"de":{"name":"Cinema Galeries","address_street_name":"Galerie de la Reine","address_street_number":"26","address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.galeries.be\/","phone_contact":"+32 2 514 74 98","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Galerie de la Reine, 26","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Das CINEMA GALERIES besteht aus zwei Kinos\u00e4len, einem gro\u00dfen Ausstellungsraum von 1000 m2 und einer Bar.\r\nDas 1939 von dem Architekten Paul Bonduelle erbaute Kino steht seit 1993 wegen seines historischen und k\u00fcnstlerischen Wertes unter Denkmalschutz; der Stil des Kinos liegt zwischen Art-d\u00e9co und Modernismus und zeichnet sich durch eine subtile mediterrane und romanische Dekoration aus. Seitdem hat das CINEMA GALERIES verschiedene Initiativen ergriffen, um die Qualit\u00e4t dieses Filmkunsttempels weiterzuentwickeln. Die vor drei Jahren in Angriff genommene Renovierung des Kinos ist inzwischen abgeschlossen. In den Kinos\u00e4len bietet das neue Soundsystem ein besseres akustisches Erlebnis.\r\n\r\nCinema Galeries ist ein Ort, der sich voll und ganz den Autorenfilmen verschrieben hat und bietet dar\u00fcber hinaus vielf\u00e4ltige Ausstellungen, die dem unabh\u00e4ngigen Kino und der zeitgen\u00f6ssischen Kunst gewidmet sind. Viele zeitgen\u00f6ssische K\u00fcnstler wie Eric Baudelaire, Amos Gitai, David Lynch, ... haben hier bereits ihre Werke pr\u00e4sentiert, die stets in Verbindung mit dem Kino stehen. Eine der wichtigsten Aufgaben des CINEMA GALERIES ist die F\u00f6rderung junger belgischer Filme. Im Rahmen der Partnerschaft mit der KissKissBankBank erm\u00f6glicht das Kino seinem Publikum, neue Projekte zu entdecken.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"it":{"name":"Cinema Galeries","address_street_name":"Galerie de la Reine","address_street_number":"26","address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.galeries.be\/","phone_contact":"+32 2 514 74 98","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Galerie de la Reine, 26","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"sp":{"name":"Cinema Galeries","address_street_name":"Galerie de la Reine","address_street_number":"26","address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.galeries.be\/","phone_contact":"+32 2 514 74 98","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Galerie de la Reine, 26","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"pt":{"name":"Cin\u00e9ma Galeries","address_street_name":"Galerie de la Reine","address_street_number":"26","address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.galeries.be\/","phone_contact":"+32 2 514 74 98","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Galerie de la Reine, 26","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"cn":{"name":"Cin\u00e9ma Galeries","address_street_name":"Galerie de la Reine","address_street_number":"26","address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.galeries.be\/","phone_contact":"+32 2 514 74 98","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Galerie de la Reine, 26","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null}},"districts":{"list":[13],"translations":{"fr":["Centre historique"],"nl":["Historisch centrum"],"en":["Historical Centre"],"de":["Historisches Stadtzentrum"],"it":[null],"sp":[null],"pt":[null],"cn":[null]}},"zones":{"list":[19],"translations":{"fr":["Centre"],"nl":["Centrum"],"en":["Centre"],"de":["Zentrum"],"it":[null],"sp":[null],"pt":[null],"cn":[null]}},"neca":null,"facebook_id":null,"backoffice_id":13088,"location":{"lat":50.84744224,"lon":4.35461261},"region":"brussels","last_updated_at":"2022-12-22T14:05:03+01:00","published_at":"2013-10-19T01:35:51+02:00","import_origin":null,"external_id":null,"is_in_address_book":true,"is_in_vb_export":true,"resto_ranking":0},"organizer":{"id":230072,"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Itin\u00e9raires","address_street_name":"Rue de l'Aqueduc","address_street_number":"171","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@itineraires.be","website":"http:\/\/www.itineraires.be","phone_contact":"+32 495 38 85 94","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Rue de l'Aqueduc, 171","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":"Professionnels dans l'organisation d\u2019\u00e9v\u00e9nements culturels depuis 1986.\r\nVous \u00eates \u00e0 la recherche d'un team-building cr\u00e9atif et culturel pour vos collaborateurs? Ou d'un programme social pour vos clients? Contactez-nous et d\u00e9couvrez nos propositions:\r\n- Rallyes inoubliables: New: \"Enigme sanglant, mais qui a tu\u00e9 monsieur le Comte?\" devenez un detective et trouvez la solution: \u00e0 pied, en tuk tuk, dans une old timer...\r\n- Chateaux et lieux exclusifs pour vos \u00e9v\u00e9nements d\u2019atmosph\u00e8re et tour VIP\r\n- Diner Thematique: Ex: Art Nouveau, possibilit\u00e9 de l'agr\u00e9menter avec: guides costum\u00e9s, musique live, interpr\u00e8te de Jacques Brel, magiciens, danseurs, acteurs,...\r\n- Itin\u00e9raires sur mesure: Art Nouveau, Anvers \u00e0 la mode, hommage \u00e0 Brel, Brussels by night, Bi\u00e8re et Chocolat, Bruxelles insolite, Simenon et Maigret, Atelier mode, design, Le Gay Bruxelles, \"Qui a tu\u00e9...\", Bruxelles durable.\r\n\r\nSur Bruxelles et toute la Belgique. Nous r\u00e9pondons sur mesure et \u00e0 la demande.\r\nNotre Equipe:\r\n- 4 professionnels pour s'assurer que votre programme atteigne vos objectifs et d\u00e9passe les attentes de vos clients.\r\n- 200 guides multilingues, acteurs, coordinateurs, hotesses,... sp\u00e9cialis\u00e9s dans la mise \u00e0 l'honneur de la Belgique et ses tr\u00e9sors cach\u00e9s.\r\n- 7 jours sur 7\r\n- Notre objectif: vivre l'Art comme un Art de Vivre.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"Itin\u00e9raires","address_street_name":"Waterleidingsstraat","address_street_number":"171","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@itineraires.be","website":"http:\/\/www.itineraires.be","phone_contact":"+32 495 38 85 94","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Elsene","address_line1":"Waterleidingsstraat, 171","address_line2":"1050 Elsene","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"Itin\u00e9raires","address_street_name":"Rue de l'Aqueduc","address_street_number":"171","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@itineraires.be","website":"http:\/\/www.itineraires.be","phone_contact":"+32 495 38 85 94","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Rue de l'Aqueduc, 171","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":"CULTURAL EVENTS SINCE 1986 \r\nAre you looking for fresh and creative incentive, team-building, or social programs for your clients? Contact us and fi nd out what\u2019s on the \u201cmenu\u201d: \r\n\u2022  Unforgettable rallies: CULTURAL CITY GAME\r\nNEW! \u201cBloody inquiry, become one of our most famous detective\u201d On foot, tuk tuk,... \r\n\u2022  Dine Around (3 courses in 3 differents venues)\r\n\u2022  Private Castles for exclusive events & atmosphere and exclusive tours\r\n\u2022  Thematic Diner: Ex: Art Nouveau, possibilities of : costumed guides, live band, a Jacques Brel singer,... \r\n\u2022  Custom-tailored itineraires: Art Nouveau, Trendy Antwerp, Brel and Brussels by night, Beer and chocolate, another Bruges, Simenon and Maigret, Fashion workshops, design, Brussels is there for you, the Gay Brussels, \u201cWho killed Sir the Count?\u201d, Sustainable Brussels.\r\n\r\nIn Brussels and all Belgium. Our programs are exclusive and interactive.\r\nOur team: \r\n\u2022  2 specialists who ensure that your program meets your objectives and exceeds your clients expectations. \r\n\u2022  100 multilingual guides, entertainers, coordinators, hotesses, ... specialists in Belgium\u2019s off  the beaten path treasures. \r\n\u2022  We answer 7 days a week \r\n\u2022 Our aim: to live art as an \u201cArt de Vivre\u201d ","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"de":{"name":"